1
00:02:32,324 --> 00:02:35,304
Kestel Castle.

2
00:03:14,526 --> 00:03:19,205
﻿People of Kestel, listen to me!

3
00:03:19,966 --> 00:03:23,005
﻿They have oppressed us for years!

4
00:03:23,126 --> 00:03:29,085
﻿They made us bleed! We
won't step back anymore!

5
00:03:29,206 --> 00:03:32,605
﻿O noble people of Byzantine! No defense!

6
00:03:32,686 --> 00:03:35,205
﻿We'll attack with all our strength!

7
00:03:35,206 --> 00:03:42,285
﻿We'll eradicate the Muslims in these
lands as if they had never existed!

8
00:03:47,846 --> 00:03:53,165
﻿Hold on, brave men! We
won't give up no matter what!

9
00:03:53,526 --> 00:03:56,245
﻿As you see, they aren't invincible.

10
00:03:56,366 --> 00:04:01,205
﻿We aren't invincible but we'll never give up!

11
00:04:01,446 --> 00:04:05,205
﻿I swear I will kill you all.

12
00:04:05,406 --> 00:04:07,525
﻿I'll be your death, Lord!

13
00:04:07,606 --> 00:04:11,685
﻿Can you speak like this when
you are skinned out, Mehmed?

14
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:15,365
﻿Soldiers, whip!

15
00:04:15,686 --> 00:04:20,644
﻿You think you can scare us? Come on, hit me!

16
00:04:24,486 --> 00:04:28,645
﻿Come on, warriors! Hang on!

17
00:04:33,446 --> 00:04:36,205
Allah is the greatest!

18
00:04:36,526 --> 00:04:39,645
﻿Hit!

19
00:04:40,526 --> 00:04:44,485
﻿Hit!

20
00:04:45,206 --> 00:04:48,845
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

21
00:04:51,246 --> 00:04:54,405
-Hit them to kill!
-Allah is the greatest!

22
00:04:59,326 --> 00:05:02,325
﻿Beg, son of Osman. If you beg,

23
00:05:02,326 --> 00:05:04,645
﻿...I may finish this torture.

24
00:05:04,806 --> 00:05:08,125
You treacherous dog!
I'd rather be eaten by birds...

25
00:05:08,366 --> 00:05:11,565
...than begging you! Come on, hit!

26
00:05:11,806 --> 00:05:16,685
﻿Hit! Listen to Orhan. Hit harder!

27
00:05:25,006 --> 00:05:27,685
﻿Hold on, my warriors!

28
00:05:28,646 --> 00:05:32,885
﻿Orhan isn't very smart.
But you and I can be friends.

29
00:05:34,446 --> 00:05:37,725
﻿I will show you who the
enemy and the friend are, Lord!

30
00:05:37,726 --> 00:05:40,925
﻿-Hit!
-I will take your filthy life out.

31
00:05:41,006 --> 00:05:43,725
﻿-Just wait for me!
-Whip!

32
00:05:44,766 --> 00:05:47,925
﻿Hit harder!

33
00:05:52,246 --> 00:05:56,925
﻿Sir, Osman's messengers are here.

34
00:05:59,846 --> 00:06:02,125
﻿Let them in.

35
00:06:09,686 --> 00:06:13,405
﻿Stop this disgrace immediately, Lord.

36
00:06:14,046 --> 00:06:17,805
﻿Release the alps and shahzades.

37
00:06:22,446 --> 00:06:27,925
﻿My castle. My prisoners. I'll
release them only if I want so.

38
00:06:42,366 --> 00:06:45,085
﻿OSMAN BEY KARARGAH

39
00:06:56,726 --> 00:07:03,445
﻿It's tearing my heart out, Osman Bey.
Mehmed... A mountainous warrior...

40
00:07:04,166 --> 00:07:09,885
﻿It's like just yesterday...
He was growing up with me.

41
00:07:11,046 --> 00:07:14,645
﻿While I couldn't even
get used to his growing up,

42
00:07:15,086 --> 00:07:22,445
﻿...this captivity is burning my heart.

43
00:07:24,566 --> 00:07:34,085
﻿You suffering is my suffering, Yakup
Bey. My son Orhan... He is my first child.

44
00:07:34,806 --> 00:07:38,488
﻿He wouldn't even stop
fighting when he was

45
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:42,445
exhausted. He would
always finish his training.

46
00:07:44,206 --> 00:07:50,165
﻿He's strong... Very strong.

47
00:07:52,446 --> 00:07:58,485
﻿They will stand. They will stand, for sure.

48
00:07:58,966 --> 00:08:02,925
﻿-My Bey.
-But it won't take very long.

49
00:08:04,326 --> 00:08:07,885
﻿Everything will be done to save our sons.

50
00:08:08,126 --> 00:08:13,925
﻿We'll hit the walls and
break the gates if we have to.

51
00:08:14,166 --> 00:08:17,685
﻿And we will take our sons back.

52
00:08:18,526 --> 00:08:22,125
﻿-Is everything set?
-Yes, my Bey.

53
00:08:53,766 --> 00:08:59,525
If we have to be silent, we are
ready for that too, praise be to Allah.

54
00:08:59,606 --> 00:09:02,005
Thank you.

55
00:09:17,966 --> 00:09:20,305
﻿Diggers, huh?

56
00:09:22,416 --> 00:09:26,005
﻿Well-thought, Osman Bey.

57
00:09:26,046 --> 00:09:31,125
﻿They won't be expecting
us to come under the ground.

58
00:09:32,166 --> 00:09:35,605
﻿If they don't release our sons in no time,

59
00:09:35,806 --> 00:09:39,645
﻿...these brave men will
dig both under Kestel...

60
00:09:39,766 --> 00:09:43,605
﻿...and the graves of those dogs.

61
00:09:45,766 --> 00:09:49,645
﻿Let's wait for the alps to bring news first.

62
00:09:49,806 --> 00:09:56,525
﻿I hope we hear our sons are
alive and our hearts stop burning.

63
00:09:57,046 --> 00:10:02,645
﻿You are saying this in case we
have to dig graves for our sons, huh?

64
00:10:05,246 --> 00:10:09,285
﻿They can't dare to do that.

65
00:10:10,446 --> 00:10:17,965
﻿Don't be worrying. There are
many things they'd demand from us.

66
00:10:21,926 --> 00:10:27,885
﻿The agreement depends on you.
Your shahzades turned out to be strong.

67
00:10:28,606 --> 00:10:32,045
﻿But let's see if they can stand this.

68
00:10:32,486 --> 00:10:35,405
﻿Soldiers.

69
00:10:40,846 --> 00:10:46,085
﻿They must be thirsty. I never leave
my prisoners without food and water!

70
00:11:06,126 --> 00:11:12,965
﻿We came here for an agreement, Lord! Release
the shahzades and we'll discuss the terms.

71
00:11:18,126 --> 00:11:22,725
﻿I will kill you.

72
00:11:32,326 --> 00:11:35,765
﻿Negotiating.

73
00:11:36,086 --> 00:11:42,165
﻿If you play by my rules,
of course we can negotiate.

74
00:11:42,566 --> 00:11:45,965
﻿Soldiers, take them away.

75
00:11:53,206 --> 00:11:58,125
﻿Konur Bey, if we
die, it is an honor!

76
00:11:58,726 --> 00:12:04,405
﻿Our name echo around the world. Don't
let these army of dogs what they want.

77
00:12:07,406 --> 00:12:15,005
﻿No sorrow, no grief go
and tell this to our families.

78
00:12:30,166 --> 00:12:33,965
﻿Tell us your rules, our patience grows thin.

79
00:12:34,206 --> 00:12:39,365
﻿Lefka, Karacahisar, Marmaracik
castles. I want all of these castles.

80
00:12:39,446 --> 00:12:43,605
﻿And I want all the tax incomes and
the treasure that these castles have.

81
00:12:43,686 --> 00:12:46,645
﻿We will never give them up!

82
00:12:48,246 --> 00:12:50,725
﻿Think again.

83
00:12:50,846 --> 00:12:57,325
﻿Your decision. If you don't
give them, I will have their heads.

84
00:12:57,406 --> 00:12:59,685
﻿Then we will impale you.

85
00:12:59,846 --> 00:13:05,285
﻿-With your frail arm?
-Yes, with that arm.

86
00:13:05,606 --> 00:13:08,965
﻿Tell Osman Bey and Yakup Bey.

87
00:13:09,046 --> 00:13:14,525
﻿I will come to Lefke to negotiate.
First, you will declare an edict.

88
00:13:14,686 --> 00:13:21,365
﻿After I get edicts and castle keys, I
will release these worthless prisoners.

89
00:13:21,566 --> 00:13:28,725
﻿Whenever I become sure that you kept your
promise, then I will release the prisoners.

90
00:13:29,006 --> 00:13:33,365
﻿You are pushing over the line, lord.

91
00:13:38,086 --> 00:13:42,685
﻿The earlier you send word to
Yakup Bey and Osman Bey..

92
00:13:42,846 --> 00:13:46,485
﻿The lesser prisoners feel pain.

93
00:13:46,566 --> 00:13:49,445
﻿What you see is just the start.

94
00:13:49,566 --> 00:13:55,045
﻿Until you accept my offer,
I will hurt them much more.

95
00:13:55,606 --> 00:13:59,925
﻿Now go.

96
00:14:23,686 --> 00:14:27,245
﻿What do you think they will want, Yakup Bey?

97
00:14:27,606 --> 00:14:32,845
﻿There is nothing more valuable than
your children in this world, Osman Bey.

98
00:14:33,086 --> 00:14:39,965
﻿What they'll want from
me will be within my reach.

99
00:14:41,566 --> 00:14:44,245
﻿Yakup Bey.

100
00:14:45,966 --> 00:14:51,925
﻿Don't let the infidels hear it.
Our children is of course valuable.

101
00:14:52,166 --> 00:14:56,565
﻿-But what you said..
-What are you saying, Osman Bey?

102
00:14:56,766 --> 00:15:01,765
﻿Yakup Bey, there will be a trade in the end.

103
00:15:01,926 --> 00:15:06,365
﻿However, are you willing
to give everything in return?

104
00:15:06,646 --> 00:15:10,365
﻿Of course I will.

105
00:15:12,086 --> 00:15:19,525
﻿However, what they will
get in the end, is death.

106
00:15:20,006 --> 00:15:25,805
﻿What for these swords are forged?
What for these catapults are built?

107
00:15:26,166 --> 00:15:33,565
﻿Even for touching my
son, I will destroy them.

108
00:15:34,646 --> 00:15:37,885
﻿Our children is of course the most valuable.

109
00:15:38,206 --> 00:15:48,965
﻿Of course, there is no doubt,
However, we will not hurry for anything.

110
00:15:49,526 --> 00:15:54,965
﻿Where Turk's foot land is the home to him.

111
00:15:55,566 --> 00:16:01,645
﻿Let us get out of this first.
Since our children is at Kestel..

112
00:16:01,886 --> 00:16:06,165
﻿It means Kestel will be ours soon.

113
00:16:06,366 --> 00:16:13,285
﻿Are you thinking about conquest, even our
when our children are in danger, Osman Bey?

114
00:16:13,886 --> 00:16:18,525
﻿We will take both Kestel, and our sons.

115
00:16:18,726 --> 00:16:23,285
﻿If we take our sons back, then with holy war.

116
00:16:23,446 --> 00:16:31,405
﻿If something happens to
our sons, then with fury.

117
00:16:31,486 --> 00:16:36,885
﻿We will go to them with fury.

118
00:16:48,806 --> 00:16:54,245
﻿My friend Makrenos, I will take back..

119
00:16:54,326 --> 00:17:00,685
﻿All the castles they
got from us. After that..

120
00:17:01,126 --> 00:17:05,964
﻿-I want their lives.
-Will they accept our offer?

121
00:17:06,046 --> 00:17:10,525
﻿All those castles, golds, ores..

122
00:17:10,685 --> 00:17:13,925
﻿Yakup will accept without thinking.

123
00:17:14,165 --> 00:17:19,765
﻿He has a very precious son,
I know. However, Osman..

124
00:17:20,286 --> 00:17:24,925
﻿-Osman will resist.
-What will we do then?

125
00:17:25,006 --> 00:17:28,965
﻿Dividing Yakup and Osman benefits us.

126
00:17:29,086 --> 00:17:34,365
﻿While they mess around, we will be on them.

127
00:17:34,526 --> 00:17:37,725
﻿We can not put a lot of soldiers to Lefke.

128
00:17:37,806 --> 00:17:43,165
﻿\Ne do not need to. The
prisoners we will release..

129
00:17:43,286 --> 00:17:46,605
﻿Why do you think they are bannerless?

130
00:17:47,166 --> 00:17:50,885
﻿They will kill Osman and Yakup.

131
00:17:51,206 --> 00:17:56,885
﻿The Bannerless will kill Osman
and Yakup. Either with easy way..

132
00:17:56,966 --> 00:18:00,965
﻿Or the hard way.

133
00:18:08,206 --> 00:18:11,685
﻿My children.

134
00:18:12,446 --> 00:18:16,445
﻿My children.

135
00:18:19,366 --> 00:18:28,085
﻿With each battle they go, my heart burns.

136
00:18:28,846 --> 00:18:36,245
﻿I understand you well, Malhun
Hatun. We are enduring the same pain.

137
00:18:36,366 --> 00:18:41,525
﻿I am standing firm like a rock..

138
00:18:41,646 --> 00:18:47,525
﻿As I am mother of Bey, however,
being a mother is something else.

139
00:18:48,966 --> 00:18:54,125
﻿It is something else.

140
00:18:55,526 --> 00:19:05,045
﻿The son I've raised protected from all evil,
now in the hands of enemy, enduring pain.

141
00:19:07,126 --> 00:19:16,605
﻿O Allah, protect our children. Do
not let merciless have a chance.

142
00:19:16,926 --> 00:19:25,085
﻿Even thinking about it hurts my
heart. This pain is nothing alike.

143
00:19:25,526 --> 00:19:34,645
﻿-It does not indeed. May Allah prevent it.
-Bala.

144
00:19:38,006 --> 00:19:45,525
﻿You don't know what
you eat, what you breathe.

145
00:19:49,606 --> 00:19:57,845
﻿Do not worry, sons are alive,
while there is life, there is hope.

146
00:19:58,206 --> 00:20:03,445
﻿We are the mother of
beys. We will stand straight.

147
00:20:04,086 --> 00:20:11,165
﻿We will stand straight
and unite. We will pray.

148
00:20:11,606 --> 00:20:21,325
﻿There is nothing we can do, Bala Hatun. We
are sitting while they are suffering there.

149
00:20:22,526 --> 00:20:31,725
﻿No, our greatest weapon is our prayer. We
will take refuge to Allah against merciless.

150
00:20:31,806 --> 00:20:40,565
﻿We will pray for every
children that is enduring cruelty.

151
00:20:45,086 --> 00:20:52,725
﻿Alps! Turn against the
wall, take your hats off.

152
00:20:56,566 --> 00:21:00,605
﻿-Will we find the traitor like this?
-We will.

153
00:21:00,766 --> 00:21:07,005
﻿With the permission of Allah, we will.

154
00:21:07,526 --> 00:21:14,605
﻿We will find them, first searching
the ones inside then the outside.

155
00:21:14,806 --> 00:21:21,525
﻿We will. Keep your eyes
peeled, check everyone.

156
00:21:21,646 --> 00:21:25,525
﻿As you command, my shahzade.

157
00:21:29,566 --> 00:21:36,205
﻿We checked the ladies they have no sign.

158
00:21:37,766 --> 00:21:39,685
﻿You continue.

159
00:21:43,806 --> 00:21:49,045
﻿Are you alright? Do you want to take a break?

160
00:21:56,206 --> 00:22:06,125
﻿Do not upset yourself. Mehmet Bey and my
brother are strong. Hopefully they'll be back.

161
00:22:07,606 --> 00:22:15,205
﻿-Do you think so?
-Of course, do not worry.

162
00:22:16,326 --> 00:22:17,125
﻿Come on.

163
00:22:33,366 --> 00:22:37,005
﻿I have a bad feeling, Alaeddin Bey.

164
00:22:54,686 --> 00:22:55,925
﻿Trickster Hatun...

165
00:23:01,766 --> 00:23:03,445
﻿Come, sit... Come.

166
00:23:17,126 --> 00:23:18,725
﻿Stop...

167
00:23:21,606 --> 00:23:25,525
﻿Don't... Don't do this.

168
00:23:25,966 --> 00:23:31,765
﻿You are as strong as your brother.

169
00:23:51,526 --> 00:23:56,645
﻿Don't cry, Trickster Hatun.

170
00:24:12,806 --> 00:24:20,565
﻿You... Aren’t you afraid for your brother?

171
00:24:26,686 --> 00:24:33,045
﻿I am... I am, sure.

172
00:24:39,846 --> 00:24:44,645
﻿But I trust my brother.

173
00:24:46,086 --> 00:24:53,925
﻿Orhan Bey is brave enough to
treat his own dislocated finger.

174
00:24:55,846 --> 00:25:01,205
He will get out of there safely, if Allah permits.

175
00:25:06,166 --> 00:25:09,405
﻿Holofira..

176
00:25:09,566 --> 00:25:15,205
﻿Can he really come out of there safely?

177
00:25:15,446 --> 00:25:22,805
﻿Sure... Besides, you know how much my
brother and Mehmed Bey love each other.

178
00:25:22,966 --> 00:25:28,365
﻿If they unite, no one can harm them.

179
00:25:32,606 --> 00:25:36,325
﻿My Shahzade..

180
00:25:36,686 --> 00:25:40,685
﻿If you allow me, Hatuns.

181
00:25:44,446 --> 00:25:51,605
﻿My Shahzade... We checked all
our Alps. We couldn't find any tracks.

182
00:25:52,966 --> 00:25:57,245
﻿Bayindir Bey. Did you check
the Alps who searched with us?

183
00:25:57,286 --> 00:26:02,045
﻿Since they are all our Alps who
we trust, I couldn't think of that.

184
00:26:02,286 --> 00:26:06,709
﻿Thanks to your mind,
my Shahzade, I will now

185
00:26:06,721 --> 00:26:11,445
question others about
Veysel, Suleyman and Hasan.

186
00:26:11,926 --> 00:26:15,365
﻿The enemy was closer than we thought.

187
00:26:15,606 --> 00:26:21,925
-We cannot trust anyone now, Bayindir Bey.
-Yes my Shahzade.

188
00:26:22,326 --> 00:26:26,565
﻿Come on.

189
00:26:27,366 --> 00:26:31,205
﻿Orhan..

190
00:26:32,486 --> 00:26:39,125
﻿Before he left, he was
going to tell something to me.

191
00:26:40,886 --> 00:26:48,045
﻿I wish I had listened to him. I
wish I had asked for him to speak.

192
00:26:48,406 --> 00:26:53,845
﻿What if he can never
say it? What if he cannot?

193
00:26:53,926 --> 00:26:57,805
﻿Do not say "I wish", Holofira...

194
00:27:02,326 --> 00:27:09,125
﻿With Allah's consent, Orhan Bey
and my brother will come here safely.

195
00:27:09,766 --> 00:27:15,965
﻿Then you will get the answer you want.

196
00:27:28,686 --> 00:27:33,445
﻿Someone is coming!

197
00:27:55,926 --> 00:27:58,805
﻿Are our children alright, Cerkutay?

198
00:27:59,046 --> 00:28:05,605
﻿They are alive, but... I
cannot say they are alright.

199
00:28:07,246 --> 00:28:10,325
﻿What do they want, Konur? Tell us.

200
00:28:10,566 --> 00:28:19,645
﻿Castles, Forts, Marmaracik, Lefke...

201
00:28:20,166 --> 00:28:26,325
﻿Karacahisar, and the taxes
that have been paid until today.

202
00:28:28,806 --> 00:28:33,165
﻿They want the treasure.

203
00:28:34,846 --> 00:28:40,623
﻿They will all be given
with firman and the keys.

204
00:28:40,635 --> 00:28:42,565
Dastard dogs.

205
00:28:43,686 --> 00:28:48,085
-When do they want to meet us?
-Tonight.

206
00:28:48,366 --> 00:28:51,925
-In Lefke.
-Good.

207
00:28:55,766 --> 00:29:02,685
﻿What are you saying Yakup Bey?
Huh? Why would we meet them?

208
00:29:03,446 --> 00:29:09,805
﻿They are asking for the lands and castles
which we took with our swords and blood.

209
00:29:10,326 --> 00:29:17,445
﻿Blood, huh? We have tens of
valiants who can shed blood..

210
00:29:18,446 --> 00:29:23,365
﻿Sword, huh? We can make thousand swords here.

211
00:29:23,766 --> 00:29:32,565
﻿But our children... We
cannot replace them, Osman.

212
00:29:35,406 --> 00:29:40,365
﻿I do not see a difference
between my son and my Alps.

213
00:29:41,206 --> 00:29:50,005
﻿It is also our blood. Do you know how many
fathers lost their children for these lands?

214
00:29:50,486 --> 00:29:55,445
﻿No... We will find a way to take...

215
00:29:55,726 --> 00:30:01,325
﻿...our children back without
giving a single castle. No.

216
00:30:01,806 --> 00:30:09,285
﻿We are not in a situation to make this
careless move. Our children are our priority.

217
00:30:15,486 --> 00:30:19,845
﻿This is the point of no return.

218
00:30:20,406 --> 00:30:26,845
﻿If you give these castles today,
they will have defeated us greatly.

219
00:30:27,686 --> 00:30:33,913
﻿will take courage, they
will even ask for Kutahya.

220
00:30:33,925 --> 00:30:36,685
Stop there, Osman Bey!

221
00:30:37,206 --> 00:30:43,325
﻿Do not overestimate your enemies
and underestimate our power.

222
00:30:44,086 --> 00:30:52,525
﻿I am the Sultan of our
lands! My heart is in pain!

223
00:30:53,766 --> 00:31:02,245
﻿Fortresses and castles will be
given. Our children will be taken back.

224
00:31:05,206 --> 00:31:10,525
﻿My heart is also in pain.

225
00:31:11,046 --> 00:31:19,285
﻿But don't forget, the lands do not belong
to the Sultan, they belong to our people.

226
00:31:20,526 --> 00:31:24,525
﻿Do not fall into that carelessness.

227
00:31:26,406 --> 00:31:33,045
﻿You will make it harder for us
and make them kill our children.

228
00:31:33,166 --> 00:31:42,045
﻿Go to your palace now. First,
find the traitor in your palace.

229
00:31:49,086 --> 00:31:53,805
﻿I will go and meet them alone.

230
00:31:54,486 --> 00:31:56,725
-Kanyumaz!
-My Bey...

231
00:31:56,846 --> 00:32:02,805
-Get ready. We will set out.
-Yes my Bey.

232
00:32:06,126 --> 00:32:08,075
﻿Konur.

233
00:32:16,886 --> 00:32:20,685
-Come on.
-Yes my Bey.

234
00:32:21,366 --> 00:32:24,525
﻿Yakup Bey..

235
00:32:25,766 --> 00:32:32,005
-If you allow me, I want to come with you.
-Come Konur, come.

236
00:32:32,126 --> 00:32:37,485
﻿You will see how I am going
to solve this issue easily.

237
00:32:37,606 --> 00:32:41,885
Alright.
Aykurt...

238
00:33:13,686 --> 00:33:18,245
-You must be hungry.
-Do you think..

239
00:33:18,526 --> 00:33:24,085
﻿..we will eat your food?

240
00:33:27,886 --> 00:33:31,565
﻿Come at me, come!

241
00:33:38,246 --> 00:33:42,285
﻿What is happening here?

242
00:33:45,206 --> 00:33:53,085
﻿You will not give them food ever again.
They should starve, so they can think wisely.

243
00:33:54,086 --> 00:33:57,485
﻿Take these!

244
00:34:00,446 --> 00:34:04,525
﻿Do you think we are going
to be scared and sit still?

245
00:34:04,926 --> 00:34:09,764
﻿You should be afraid of
your own fate, you dogs!

246
00:34:12,005 --> 00:34:17,165
﻿Don’t worry... Soon, I
will send you all to hell.

247
00:34:17,726 --> 00:34:21,925
﻿Are you going to scare
us with death, dastard?

248
00:34:22,446 --> 00:34:26,965
﻿Did you hear him? He is not afraid of death.

249
00:34:27,045 --> 00:34:32,445
﻿If we die, we become
martyrs. But if you die...

250
00:34:32,565 --> 00:34:36,485
﻿...and I will kill you all
with my own hands...

251
00:34:36,606 --> 00:34:39,382
﻿...even jackals will not
want to eat your dead body.

252
00:34:39,395 --> 00:34:40,324
Is that so?

253
00:34:40,446 --> 00:34:43,605
﻿Right.

254
00:34:47,085 --> 00:34:51,205
﻿Dastard dog!

255
00:34:56,085 --> 00:34:59,765
﻿I like you, Orhan.

256
00:35:01,046 --> 00:35:04,365
﻿Come on. We are leaving.

257
00:35:27,286 --> 00:35:34,405
﻿Mehmed Bey and Orhan Bey will
be given in exchange for Karacahisar

258
00:35:34,846 --> 00:35:39,445
﻿Marmaracik and Lefke Castles.

259
00:35:39,686 --> 00:35:43,805
﻿Thankfully. Thankfully, my Rabb.

260
00:35:48,046 --> 00:35:51,285
﻿What are you saying, Cerkutay?

261
00:35:51,366 --> 00:35:54,285
﻿-They are all right, right?
-They are.

262
00:35:54,446 --> 00:36:01,605
﻿They are all right. They will be better
when we take them back from the infidels.

263
00:36:03,926 --> 00:36:07,245
﻿Baysungur. What does
Osman Bey say about this?

264
00:36:07,446 --> 00:36:11,165
﻿This is Yakup Bey's decision.

265
00:36:11,846 --> 00:36:16,965
﻿Osman Bey will obey this decision.

266
00:36:27,126 --> 00:36:31,325
﻿Osman Bey says that...

267
00:36:35,286 --> 00:36:39,565
﻿Saadet Hatun, Osman
Bey will ruin this exchange.

268
00:36:39,766 --> 00:36:44,125
﻿Yakup Bey said that keep
your eyes on the Hatuns.

269
00:36:44,566 --> 00:36:50,165
﻿It is about the life of my
child. I’ll be watching them.

270
00:37:02,566 --> 00:37:08,725
﻿Since we got the blessed
news, let's get back to work.

271
00:37:09,086 --> 00:37:12,693
﻿The palace will be
searched and we will not

272
00:37:12,705 --> 00:37:16,485
stop until we find the
traitor inside. Come on.

273
00:37:32,406 --> 00:37:35,326
My Shahzade, everyone
except Veysel has been searched.

274
00:37:35,326 --> 00:37:38,593
Find Veysel as
soon as possible.

275
00:38:17,726 --> 00:38:22,085
﻿Your dream can only be a mere imagination.

276
00:38:22,286 --> 00:38:23,464
Excuse me?

277
00:38:23,476 --> 00:38:27,045
You're dreaming about
something but that won't work.

278
00:38:27,246 --> 00:38:31,925
﻿They will upset you here a lot
Holofira. They don't value enough.

279
00:38:32,006 --> 00:38:34,355
Sometimes you see right
through me Saadet Hatun.

280
00:38:34,355 --> 00:38:35,365
Motherhood.

281
00:38:35,446 --> 00:38:38,685
﻿Mothers see through their children's eyes.

282
00:38:38,766 --> 00:38:42,765
﻿I loved you at the moment
I saw you as my own child.

283
00:38:42,926 --> 00:38:47,085
﻿I lost my mother when I was so little.

284
00:38:47,846 --> 00:38:51,525
﻿There was no one to replace her.

285
00:38:52,926 --> 00:38:57,725
﻿Then be my daughter-in-law.

286
00:39:00,766 --> 00:39:05,685
﻿And become one of my children.

287
00:39:13,966 --> 00:39:19,405
﻿What's going on Saadet Hatun
is what we're hearing true?

288
00:39:19,566 --> 00:39:27,005
﻿Of course, why would it be wrong? How
can I find a better bride than Holofira?

289
00:39:33,286 --> 00:39:37,525
﻿Son, what happened?

290
00:39:37,646 --> 00:39:41,485
﻿We have captured the traitor
inside the palace, my Valide.

291
00:39:42,366 --> 00:39:45,845
﻿Who is that?

292
00:39:47,286 --> 00:39:48,685
﻿Holofira.

293
00:39:54,446 --> 00:40:00,965
﻿And this is the proof. It was in her room.

294
00:40:05,246 --> 00:40:09,245
﻿Fatma, how could you
think that I'd to such a thing?

295
00:40:09,446 --> 00:40:14,965
﻿What are you saying? Holofira
wouldn't do such a thing.

296
00:40:17,726 --> 00:40:20,445
﻿How could you do this to us?

297
00:40:20,606 --> 00:40:25,165
﻿I didn't do anything.
I didn't do anything.

298
00:40:25,366 --> 00:40:28,805
﻿Sisters! Take Holofira to the dungeon.

299
00:40:29,206 --> 00:40:34,485
﻿Holofira and her helpers will be
questioned. Take them all to the dungeon.

300
00:40:34,686 --> 00:40:37,725
﻿-Come on!
-I didn't do anything.

301
00:40:37,726 --> 00:40:40,645
﻿Malhun Hatun. I wouldn't do
something like this to Orhan.

302
00:40:40,806 --> 00:40:47,805
﻿I said I didn't do it. How could
you think that I did this? Let me go!

303
00:40:57,926 --> 00:41:03,805
﻿What are they trying to do? Even I
know that Holofira wouldn't betray Orhan.

304
00:41:04,046 --> 00:41:08,165
﻿-Doesn't Malhun know that?
-It seems they are after something, mother.

305
00:41:08,526 --> 00:41:12,005
﻿Cerkutay Bey, get the Alps ready.

306
00:41:12,326 --> 00:41:18,725
﻿Yakup Bey is right. They will do
something. Keep your eyes open.

307
00:41:24,206 --> 00:41:28,485
﻿You are wrong. I don't know
where did that cage come from.

308
00:41:28,526 --> 00:41:33,485
﻿Fatma. You need to listen to
me I would never do this to Orhan.

309
00:41:33,566 --> 00:41:36,685
﻿Come on Holofira, come on.

310
00:41:36,766 --> 00:41:40,565
﻿-That cage isn't mine.
-Move.

311
00:41:42,086 --> 00:41:48,765
﻿We know that, Holofira. We
put the cage in your room.

312
00:41:57,638 --> 00:41:58,756
What's going on?

313
00:41:58,756 --> 00:42:05,445
We did it to sneak you out of
the palace. We had no other choice.

314
00:42:06,046 --> 00:42:09,943
﻿We cannot trust anyone
but ourselves. Osman

315
00:42:09,955 --> 00:42:14,125
Bey is waiting for us,
come on, we have no time.

316
00:42:27,446 --> 00:42:31,285
﻿Have a safe journey.

317
00:42:46,166 --> 00:42:49,645
﻿Osman Bey will not just stop,
he'll definitely plan something.

318
00:42:49,726 --> 00:42:55,165
﻿They are so mindless. They'll let my child
die for a few lands. I won't let them do that.

319
00:42:55,286 --> 00:43:00,405
﻿Mother, if they're doing such a move,
there must be a reason that they trust.

320
00:43:00,806 --> 00:43:04,125
﻿What's going on with you Gonca?

321
00:43:04,286 --> 00:43:09,285
﻿What reason are you looking
for? It is clear, they are blinded.

322
00:43:09,406 --> 00:43:13,445
﻿Let's go to the dungeon, come on.

323
00:43:18,826 --> 00:43:20,344
Open the door.

324
00:43:20,344 --> 00:43:23,605
Bala Hatun gave strict
orders. No one will enter.

325
00:43:24,166 --> 00:43:28,765
﻿Don't you know who I
am? I said open the door.

326
00:43:32,806 --> 00:43:36,965
﻿Saadet Hatun.

327
00:43:42,606 --> 00:43:45,845
﻿What are you doing Bala?

328
00:43:46,206 --> 00:43:49,285
﻿My child's life is at stake.

329
00:43:49,486 --> 00:43:54,005
﻿We're doing everything for our children.

330
00:43:56,046 --> 00:44:04,485
﻿You have your son with you, Bala. My son,
the heir of our throne is held by infidels.

331
00:44:04,566 --> 00:44:08,965
﻿While there's peace, I
cannot let you ruin that.

332
00:44:09,006 --> 00:44:11,725
﻿What peace are you
talking about Saadet Hatun?

333
00:44:11,726 --> 00:44:15,805
﻿So many people of ours
were martyred for those castles.

334
00:44:17,766 --> 00:44:21,335
How will we look at them in
the afterlife if we give them away...

335
00:44:21,335 --> 00:44:23,655
Enough, Bala!

336
00:44:29,646 --> 00:44:33,765
﻿Move away, or...

337
00:44:34,006 --> 00:44:35,085
﻿Mother.

338
00:44:40,606 --> 00:44:46,525
﻿Gonca, it is about your brother’s life.

339
00:44:53,406 --> 00:44:58,645
﻿Move away peacefully, otherwise...

340
00:44:59,166 --> 00:45:02,885
﻿Otherwise, what?

341
00:45:05,526 --> 00:45:11,525
﻿This is my palace, Saadet
Hatun, put down your weapons.

342
00:45:11,726 --> 00:45:13,925
﻿Alps! Sisters!

343
00:45:14,006 --> 00:45:16,485
﻿-Bala.
-Arrest them all.

344
00:45:16,606 --> 00:45:20,045
﻿I said Bala!

345
00:45:48,446 --> 00:45:52,605
﻿If my child gets hurt,

346
00:45:52,966 --> 00:45:56,605
﻿-I’ll hurt you.
-Enough.

347
00:45:57,046 --> 00:46:00,245
﻿I said it calmly, but you didn't get it.

348
00:46:00,406 --> 00:46:05,725
﻿We won't talk anymore, you'll wait in
the dungeon until your child returns.

349
00:46:06,126 --> 00:46:09,525
﻿-Come on!
-I won't let you get away with this.

350
00:46:09,686 --> 00:46:14,045
﻿-Take her.
-Let go off me!

351
00:47:03,326 --> 00:47:06,365
﻿I won't let you get away with this, Bala.

352
00:47:06,486 --> 00:47:11,605
﻿When your son comes back, your
anger will cool down, Saadet Hatun.

353
00:47:11,726 --> 00:47:14,685
﻿We're doing this for your good.

354
00:47:15,246 --> 00:47:18,885
﻿-If my son is harmed..
-We should pray...

355
00:47:19,086 --> 00:47:24,365
﻿Saadet Hatun, we should pray
for them to come back safely.

356
00:47:58,246 --> 00:48:02,685
﻿Cerkutay, if it is too hard for you...

357
00:48:03,526 --> 00:48:06,525
﻿It was also hard back then.

358
00:48:06,966 --> 00:48:11,445
﻿And none of you wanted
to make it easy for me.

359
00:48:13,126 --> 00:48:17,605
﻿Open it. Open.

360
00:49:27,686 --> 00:49:31,165
﻿-Let's go somewhere else, brother.
-No.

361
00:49:31,206 --> 00:49:34,885
﻿I don't want. I don't..

362
00:49:35,166 --> 00:49:38,925
﻿I don't want your mercy
that you didn't give me once.

363
00:49:39,126 --> 00:49:44,845
﻿Don't think about me.
Don't you think about me.

364
00:50:28,286 --> 00:50:33,685
﻿You are making a mistake. There
is going back from this, Scholar.

365
00:50:33,686 --> 00:50:37,365
﻿I am Scholar again? Well...

366
00:50:37,846 --> 00:50:41,445
﻿Trickster Hatun, I don't
want you hold you in prison.

367
00:50:41,446 --> 00:50:45,445
﻿But as you are a tricksters
I can only keep you here.

368
00:50:46,646 --> 00:50:53,565
﻿-Alaaddin Bey, if my brothers is harmed...
-Gonca Hatun.

369
00:50:54,086 --> 00:51:01,565
﻿Just trust me. You'll see.
They will be back safely.

370
00:51:07,486 --> 00:51:11,405
﻿I don't believe you anymore, Scholar.

371
00:51:32,646 --> 00:51:35,405
﻿Boran, they are coming.
Make preparations quickly.

372
00:51:35,566 --> 00:51:40,845
﻿As you order, my Bey.
Hurry up, brothers! Come on!

373
00:52:01,726 --> 00:52:06,165
﻿We're going there in these, huh?

374
00:52:11,166 --> 00:52:14,725
﻿Unbelievable! Is this your idea, Gurbuz?

375
00:52:14,806 --> 00:52:18,565
﻿Everyone has different skills, brother.

376
00:52:18,806 --> 00:52:22,925
﻿-We'll conquer the castle with this.
-Just wait, brother.

377
00:52:23,606 --> 00:52:27,885
﻿We won’t go there in barrels this time.

378
00:52:28,166 --> 00:52:31,525
﻿We have a different duty.

379
00:52:35,006 --> 00:52:39,965
﻿You'll be beside the cart with these clothes.

380
00:52:40,286 --> 00:52:44,125
﻿Your skills have gone for nothing, huh?

381
00:52:54,126 --> 00:52:55,285
﻿Osman.

382
00:52:57,886 --> 00:53:01,165
﻿-Osman. Our sons?
-Don't worry.

383
00:53:01,166 --> 00:53:03,365
﻿-We'll take them back.
-I know.

384
00:53:03,406 --> 00:53:06,205
﻿I know but I have a mother's heart, you know.

385
00:53:06,566 --> 00:53:09,765
﻿Malhun, stay strong.

386
00:53:09,926 --> 00:53:13,245
﻿We won't harm the sons.
Don't worry.

387
00:53:13,486 --> 00:53:16,325
﻿I completely trust you.

388
00:53:17,286 --> 00:53:23,485
﻿Holofira, now tell me everything
you know about Kestel.

389
00:53:24,006 --> 00:53:28,365
﻿This matters for Orhan's life.

390
00:53:28,526 --> 00:53:34,965
﻿Osman Bey, Kestel has
three big and two small gates.

391
00:53:35,166 --> 00:53:41,125
﻿One of the big gates is
here. And the other one here.

392
00:53:41,686 --> 00:53:49,645
﻿Two of the small gates are here. And
the other one is under these tunnels.

393
00:53:51,406 --> 00:53:55,845
﻿I think we should go through this gate.

394
00:54:09,846 --> 00:54:13,405
﻿You say all the hidden
passages are known, huh, Aykut?

395
00:54:13,566 --> 00:54:17,845
-For sure, Konur Bey.
-Alright.

396
00:54:22,846 --> 00:54:28,285
Praise be! Praise be!
You took all the measures, Konur.

397
00:54:28,286 --> 00:54:32,365
﻿Well, Yakup Bey. This is
the only the part that you see.

398
00:54:32,606 --> 00:54:37,405
﻿We'll host many heathens, you
know. So we need good measures.

399
00:54:37,486 --> 00:54:43,645
﻿Good. Good. I'll rest until the dark.

400
00:54:43,966 --> 00:54:48,285
﻿Finish all the preparations.
They are going to come,

401
00:54:48,406 --> 00:54:53,565
﻿...take the castles and
citadels and release our sons.

402
00:54:53,846 --> 00:54:55,085
Okay.

403
00:55:01,766 --> 00:55:06,045
﻿Aykut, listen to me carefully.

404
00:55:06,126 --> 00:55:09,845
﻿Keep your eyes wide open.
I'll ask you to do something.

405
00:55:10,086 --> 00:55:13,285
﻿And you'll do exactly what I say.

406
00:55:13,566 --> 00:55:16,194
Find some Christian
soldier clothes for me first.

407
00:55:16,194 --> 00:55:17,713
I will, Konur Bey.

408
00:55:41,806 --> 00:55:46,885
﻿Well, I have heard that...

409
00:55:47,086 --> 00:55:54,525
﻿...The Bannerless are fond of
gold and money. Is that true?

410
00:55:55,366 --> 00:55:58,765
﻿You dog who is afraid
of showing the face off!

411
00:55:59,206 --> 00:56:04,285
﻿We don't draw swords against
Muslims for the belongings of heathens.

412
00:56:04,406 --> 00:56:12,645
﻿Well, gold is simple. When we get
out of here and loot their caravans,

413
00:56:13,006 --> 00:56:16,645
﻿..it will be all ours.

414
00:56:17,366 --> 00:56:25,885
﻿Well, it seems to me that you will
never be able to get out of this dungeon.

415
00:56:28,886 --> 00:56:33,525
﻿You bloody heathens! Leave my brother!

416
00:56:34,086 --> 00:56:37,645
﻿Leave him!

417
00:56:51,806 --> 00:56:57,285
﻿They offered our offer. They
are expecting me in Lefke.

418
00:56:57,926 --> 00:57:03,325
﻿Good. As for you

419
00:57:03,726 --> 00:57:07,845
﻿-The Bannerless.
-Come here.

420
00:57:08,046 --> 00:57:15,285
﻿You and your three men.
You'll go to Lefke with Lord Makronos.

421
00:57:15,846 --> 00:57:20,765
﻿When Osman and Yakup declare their firmans,

422
00:57:20,926 --> 00:57:27,645
﻿..you will be released. Then
in an unexpected moment,

423
00:57:28,726 --> 00:57:33,965
﻿...you will go under their noses.

424
00:57:34,166 --> 00:57:38,645
﻿And you'll stick your dagger into his heart.

425
00:57:38,646 --> 00:57:42,725
﻿Release my brother.

426
00:57:42,846 --> 00:57:46,045
﻿I will release your brothers.

427
00:57:46,366 --> 00:57:52,085
﻿If you do what I say, I will
release your beloved brothers.

428
00:57:52,206 --> 00:57:58,285
﻿This is my offer for you. If
you don't accept, I will kill...

429
00:57:58,486 --> 00:58:03,525
﻿...your beloved brothers
one by one. And it'll be painful!

430
00:58:21,486 --> 00:58:27,405
﻿Enough!Enough. Enough!

431
00:58:32,246 --> 00:58:41,605
﻿Make your choice. Gold and your
brothers or dying in this dark dungeon?

432
00:58:47,166 --> 00:58:53,845
﻿Save your breath for Osman. You will need it.

433
00:59:12,526 --> 00:59:15,645
﻿Stop!

434
00:59:21,166 --> 00:59:24,005
﻿Soldiers, why did you stop us?

435
00:59:24,006 --> 00:59:30,725
﻿Mighty Lord's strict orders.
All the carts will be searched.

436
00:59:33,446 --> 00:59:39,165
﻿What is under this?

437
00:59:42,606 --> 00:59:45,885
﻿Osman Bey...

438
00:59:53,646 --> 00:59:58,485
﻿Put those soldiers in the chests now.

439
01:00:03,966 --> 01:00:08,885
﻿-Here you are, my Bey.
-Here we go.

440
01:00:32,646 --> 01:00:35,805
﻿-Did you find Veysel?
-My Shahzade.

441
01:00:35,886 --> 01:00:39,925
﻿We looked everywhere.
It's like he disappeared.

442
01:00:40,286 --> 01:00:42,525
﻿-Maybe he escaped?
-No.

443
01:00:42,606 --> 01:00:46,845
﻿Every door is locked, he can not escape.

444
01:00:47,006 --> 01:00:51,725
﻿My shahzade, they saw Veysel near alps room.

445
01:00:52,086 --> 01:00:56,325
﻿-Bayindir, quickly.
-Come on.

446
01:01:01,086 --> 01:01:04,205
﻿-Veysel.
-My shahzade.

447
01:01:04,606 --> 01:01:09,445
﻿We are looking for you until
morning, where were you?

448
01:01:09,526 --> 01:01:14,445
﻿My shahzade, I had a duty complete.

449
01:01:14,526 --> 01:01:20,885
﻿Is that so? How long does this duty take?

450
01:01:21,646 --> 01:01:26,325
﻿Do you want something from me, my shahzade?

451
01:01:33,366 --> 01:01:38,005
﻿My shahzade, did I make a
mistake? What is happening?

452
01:01:38,166 --> 01:01:41,805
﻿We will learn what you did.

453
01:01:51,406 --> 01:01:55,805
﻿No marks. Let him go.

454
01:01:59,566 --> 01:02:05,365
﻿My shahzade, what did I do
wrong for you to see me as a traitor?

455
01:02:05,446 --> 01:02:13,565
﻿It is a precaution Veysel.
We are checking everyone.

456
01:02:22,406 --> 01:02:27,205
﻿-No offence, Veysel.
-None taken.

457
01:02:27,326 --> 01:02:33,685
This issue should not divide us,
this precaution is for everyone.

458
01:02:35,806 --> 01:02:39,805
Okay.

459
01:02:57,926 --> 01:03:05,245
﻿Sultan Yakup, it is an
honor to see you in our castle.

460
01:03:05,446 --> 01:03:08,645
﻿Where is Osman Bey?

461
01:03:09,246 --> 01:03:13,445
﻿What do you need Osman Bey for?

462
01:03:13,726 --> 01:03:20,005
﻿You have the Sultan of
Turks. Know your place, lord.

463
01:03:20,246 --> 01:03:26,325
﻿You are talking without weighing,
just because you have our sons.

464
01:03:26,526 --> 01:03:33,525
﻿-Don't test my patience.
-Same goes for you.

465
01:03:34,206 --> 01:03:37,685
﻿Even if you're a Sultan,
pick your words carefully..

466
01:03:37,766 --> 01:03:45,725
﻿Since your heir is in our hands.

467
01:03:46,166 --> 01:03:52,125
﻿The forts and castles you
want will be given to you.

468
01:03:53,326 --> 01:03:59,925
﻿First, we will start with Lefke. Bring it.

469
01:04:03,646 --> 01:04:07,805
﻿I keep my promise, lord.

470
01:04:07,886 --> 01:04:12,245
﻿Now you send word to Kestel.

471
01:04:12,326 --> 01:04:16,485
﻿-They may release the hostages.
-No, Yakup Bey.

472
01:04:16,566 --> 01:04:20,805
﻿It is not that easy.
You will give all the lands.

473
01:04:20,886 --> 01:04:25,165
﻿Then we will deliver your
sons with our soldiers.

474
01:04:25,526 --> 01:04:29,085
﻿Lord.

475
01:04:29,446 --> 01:04:34,405
﻿It is certain that your intention is..

476
01:04:34,606 --> 01:04:38,645
﻿Trading your life in return to all of yours.

477
01:04:39,366 --> 01:04:42,605
﻿If you cross the line one more time.

478
01:04:42,846 --> 01:04:45,525
﻿You can not do anything to us, Yakup Bey.

479
01:04:45,526 --> 01:04:51,045
﻿As we have your son in
our hands we have you too.

480
01:04:59,446 --> 01:05:02,645
﻿Two guards are waiting at the door.

481
01:05:02,886 --> 01:05:06,125
﻿We will handle it quietly. Hasan.

482
01:05:06,206 --> 01:05:11,045
﻿-Scout the area.
-As you command.

483
01:05:31,086 --> 01:05:35,725
﻿-Alps.
-Quickly.

484
01:05:38,526 --> 01:05:44,685
﻿-Osman, what is happening?
-The door is closed, they built a wall.

485
01:05:44,926 --> 01:05:48,685
﻿I didn't know, Osman Bey.

486
01:05:51,286 --> 01:05:55,205
﻿-Do you know any other entrance?
-There is one other way, however..

487
01:05:55,206 --> 01:05:58,205
﻿-It is nearly impossible to get in.
-Tell me where quickly.

488
01:05:58,326 --> 01:06:01,565
﻿Just near the place where
Kestel guards store their weapons.

489
01:06:01,646 --> 01:06:03,845
﻿Quickly, let us go.

490
01:06:03,966 --> 01:06:07,765
﻿May Allah protect our children.

491
01:06:24,086 --> 01:06:27,965
﻿This is the place Osman Bey.

492
01:06:37,006 --> 01:06:39,285
﻿-Boran.
-Bey.

493
01:06:39,486 --> 01:06:43,125
﻿-You know what to do.
-We do, Bey.

494
01:06:43,286 --> 01:06:46,005
﻿Quickly.

495
01:06:52,046 --> 01:06:58,525
﻿They will not notice their
absence. Let us go inside.

496
01:07:07,526 --> 01:07:12,845
﻿Deliver the key of Lefke..

497
01:07:13,006 --> 01:07:17,525
﻿To the lord.

498
01:07:17,726 --> 01:07:22,165
﻿Or, his conditions will be grim.

499
01:07:33,326 --> 01:07:36,725
﻿How did Osman allow this, Sultan Yakup?

500
01:07:36,966 --> 01:07:41,125
﻿Getting these forts and
castles took him years.

501
01:07:41,446 --> 01:07:46,165
﻿Because you don't have
Osman Bey in front of you now.

502
01:07:46,566 --> 01:07:50,765
﻿You have Sultan Yakup in front of you.

503
01:07:51,046 --> 01:07:57,325
﻿These forts and castles that took
Osman to conquer many years..

504
01:07:57,566 --> 01:08:01,165
﻿That gives you the taste of victory..

505
01:08:01,246 --> 01:08:06,365
﻿Is no bigger than my hunting hall.

506
01:08:06,446 --> 01:08:09,925
﻿Also, I am the conqueror of Lefke.

507
01:08:10,086 --> 01:08:16,205
﻿To show that my
intentions are true, soldiers!

508
01:08:26,406 --> 01:08:30,645
﻿We release this many prisoners for Lefke.

509
01:08:31,006 --> 01:08:35,725
﻿When our other requests are
met, your shahzade will be free.

510
01:08:35,926 --> 01:08:38,725
﻿Untie him.

511
01:08:42,526 --> 01:08:48,085
﻿Do not worry, lord. You
will get what you want.

512
01:08:48,166 --> 01:08:53,245
﻿Now, give us the edict that
proves Lefke belongs to us.

513
01:08:53,446 --> 01:08:54,725
﻿Kanyumaz, bring it.

514
01:09:03,206 --> 01:09:09,965
﻿Raise the crusader flags, soldiers.
Yakup Bey is giving Lefke to its real owner.

515
01:09:13,926 --> 01:09:20,125
﻿You will reuinte with your coins and
your family after you finish your duty.

516
01:09:46,126 --> 01:09:48,285
﻿-Is this the place?
-Yes, Osman Bey.

517
01:09:48,286 --> 01:09:52,085
﻿If we pass behind this door, we'll get
to a passage close to the dungeons.

518
01:09:52,086 --> 01:09:54,205
﻿“Thankfully.
-Come on, let's hurry up Alps.

519
01:09:54,206 --> 01:09:56,045
﻿Come on.

520
01:10:10,126 --> 01:10:14,285
﻿Come on, come on.
Hurry up.

521
01:10:14,486 --> 01:10:16,205
﻿Come on.

522
01:10:52,566 --> 01:10:53,725
﻿-Boran.
-My Bey.

523
01:10:53,726 --> 01:10:56,365
-Tell Alps to wait at the passages.
-Okay my Bey.

524
01:10:56,366 --> 01:10:57,885
﻿Ayaz, stop.

525
01:11:56,806 --> 01:12:01,525
﻿-Orhan!
-Orhan!

526
01:12:03,806 --> 01:12:09,085
﻿Orhan! Orhan!

527
01:12:12,406 --> 01:12:15,125
﻿Boran! Give me the keys!

528
01:12:15,726 --> 01:12:17,645
﻿-They’re not here my Bey.
-Osman.

529
01:12:17,886 --> 01:12:20,965
﻿Osman, do something, please!

530
01:12:24,566 --> 01:12:29,565
﻿Osman, are you looking for this?

531
01:12:31,366 --> 01:12:36,245
﻿No one can take men without
my permission from this dungeon.

532
01:12:40,286 --> 01:12:44,645
﻿I'll take your head too,
and I'll take my son back.

533
01:12:55,766 --> 01:12:59,205
﻿Orhan, hang on, please.

534
01:12:59,286 --> 01:13:01,485
﻿My Bey.

535
01:13:10,766 --> 01:13:13,165
﻿Orhan, hang on.

536
01:13:24,326 --> 01:13:27,925
﻿Orhan, Orhan!

537
01:13:28,246 --> 01:13:32,725
﻿Orhan, Orhan, what did they do to you son?

538
01:13:33,766 --> 01:13:37,285
﻿-My Bey.
-He's all right, he's all right.

539
01:13:37,366 --> 01:13:41,445
Thankfully you are alive. Thank Allah.

540
01:13:41,526 --> 01:13:44,405
﻿Thankfully he is all right.

541
01:13:55,886 --> 01:13:59,365
﻿Mehmed, Mehmed.

542
01:14:01,726 --> 01:14:04,045
﻿Oh my son.

543
01:14:04,206 --> 01:14:07,405
﻿Mehmed. Mehmed.

544
01:14:07,606 --> 01:14:09,085
﻿Osman Bey.

545
01:14:10,606 --> 01:14:14,365
﻿-You're all right too.
-Thankfully.

546
01:14:15,926 --> 01:14:18,405
﻿-Thankfully.
-Holofira.

547
01:14:18,526 --> 01:14:22,525
﻿Holofira, untie his legs, come on.

548
01:14:24,926 --> 01:14:28,965
﻿Come on, you're leaving.

549
01:14:30,166 --> 01:14:32,445
﻿-My Bey.
-Gurbuz.

550
01:14:32,526 --> 01:14:36,165
﻿Kestel is up, soldiers are coming.

551
01:14:37,766 --> 01:14:41,925
﻿They'll come for us when they
see there are no soldiers left here.

552
01:14:42,046 --> 01:14:44,645
﻿-Come on, let's go to the hidden passages.
-Come on.

553
01:14:44,726 --> 01:14:47,085
﻿-Come on.
-Come here son, get up.

554
01:14:47,166 --> 01:14:49,605
﻿Get up, come on.

555
01:14:57,646 --> 01:14:59,005
﻿-Boran.
-My Bey.

556
01:14:59,086 --> 01:15:01,325
﻿Throw the fire arrows, we got the boys.

557
01:15:01,406 --> 01:15:03,405
Okay my Bey.

558
01:15:08,286 --> 01:15:12,845
﻿Come on, come on.

559
01:15:24,246 --> 01:15:27,045
Allah is the Greatest!

560
01:16:08,126 --> 01:16:11,605
﻿Hang on, son. Hang on.

561
01:16:13,286 --> 01:16:16,205
﻿Come on Orhan.

562
01:16:54,806 --> 01:16:58,325
﻿Sultan Yakup, you couldn't let your son die.

563
01:16:58,406 --> 01:17:02,405
﻿Your compassion and your
love are your weaknesses.

564
01:17:02,726 --> 01:17:06,645
﻿Believe me, this will be your end.

565
01:17:21,166 --> 01:17:23,845
﻿Wait, Yakup Bey.

566
01:17:27,726 --> 01:17:32,445
﻿Neither crescent loses against the cross
nor our lands can be captured by the enemy.

567
01:17:34,606 --> 01:17:40,725
﻿The deal is broken, Osman Bey went to
Kestel and saved Osman and Mehmed.

568
01:17:42,126 --> 01:17:47,405
﻿It is a lie! You're lying!
We still have Mehmed!

569
01:17:50,046 --> 01:17:52,885
﻿Osman can do anything.

570
01:17:53,646 --> 01:17:58,565
﻿But he never lies. Now, tell me.

571
01:17:58,646 --> 01:18:01,005
﻿Who can save you from me?

572
01:18:01,126 --> 01:18:04,165
﻿Your son survived but you won't!

573
01:18:04,286 --> 01:18:07,965
﻿Don't let him go!

574
01:18:27,326 --> 01:18:32,005
﻿Catch him!

575
01:18:32,846 --> 01:18:36,685
﻿Alps, stop them, don't let them pass.

576
01:18:42,006 --> 01:18:46,165
﻿Lefke will be washed by your
blood Yakup, you will all die!

577
01:18:46,326 --> 01:18:48,205
﻿Yakup Bey, stay behind us.

578
01:18:48,286 --> 01:18:49,445
﻿At such a time

579
01:18:49,566 --> 01:18:52,525
﻿it is not right to stay
behind and hide, Konur.

580
01:18:52,606 --> 01:18:55,165
﻿Attack!

581
01:19:21,646 --> 01:19:24,325
﻿Gonca Hatun.

582
01:19:25,646 --> 01:19:28,005
﻿Scholar?

583
01:19:29,166 --> 01:19:32,965
﻿Any news about my brother?

584
01:19:35,766 --> 01:19:41,365
﻿Why are you here then? To
make fun of my miserable state?

585
01:19:46,566 --> 01:19:49,805
﻿Do you think I have fun with this?

586
01:19:50,686 --> 01:19:52,565
﻿I don't know.

587
01:19:54,406 --> 01:19:57,525
﻿I don't know you anymore, Alaeddin Bey.

588
01:19:57,726 --> 01:19:59,605
﻿You have too many faces.

589
01:19:59,726 --> 01:20:03,805
﻿-And now you're calling me two-faced.
-However you want to understand it.

590
01:20:08,846 --> 01:20:12,525
﻿Say it, why are you here?

591
01:20:13,526 --> 01:20:16,645
﻿You were coughing.

592
01:20:17,366 --> 01:20:21,765
﻿I boiled some herbs. They'll be helpful.

593
01:20:24,086 --> 01:20:29,765
﻿You put me in the dungeon and
then bring me the cure, is that so?

594
01:20:30,326 --> 01:20:33,565
﻿That's what I'm talking about.

595
01:20:34,166 --> 01:20:38,445
﻿-I don't understand you, Alaeddin Bey.
-What about you?

596
01:20:38,966 --> 01:20:43,365
﻿Does everything you do has
a meaning, Trickster Hatun?

597
01:20:53,886 --> 01:20:56,725
﻿Have a blessed night.

598
01:20:57,246 --> 01:20:59,645
﻿If you get some news.

599
01:21:00,726 --> 01:21:04,565
﻿I'll let you know, don't worry.

600
01:21:32,966 --> 01:21:35,605
﻿Lord Makrenos, the hidden passage is here.

601
01:21:35,686 --> 01:21:37,565
﻿Let's go.

602
01:21:44,846 --> 01:21:48,685
﻿Kill them. Search everywhere!

603
01:21:59,846 --> 01:22:04,965
﻿They escaped through the hidden
passage. Go after them, come on!

604
01:22:08,326 --> 01:22:11,005
﻿I'll not stop

605
01:22:11,086 --> 01:22:15,165
﻿until I exterminate the ones
who tried to hurt my son.

606
01:22:19,966 --> 01:22:25,485
﻿My Allah... We have no
one else to ask help from.

607
01:22:25,566 --> 01:22:29,805
﻿My brother is a brave, an honest man.

608
01:22:30,486 --> 01:22:36,685
﻿Protect him, do not test us with his grief.

609
01:22:38,126 --> 01:22:43,725
﻿You are the One Who Protects
You are the One Who Gives...

610
01:22:43,926 --> 01:22:47,525
﻿Let my brother be with us, my Allah.

611
01:22:48,526 --> 01:22:51,245
﻿Aameen.

612
01:22:52,286 --> 01:22:55,954
﻿If you want to support
people who make a

613
01:23:23,846 --> 01:23:27,285
-My Fatma..
-Mother...

614
01:23:27,606 --> 01:23:32,445
﻿My beautiful daughter... Don't cry.

615
01:23:32,646 --> 01:23:36,525
﻿With Allah's consent, your brother will come.

616
01:23:36,846 --> 01:23:40,965
-He will come, right, mother?
-Right.

617
01:23:44,686 --> 01:23:47,285
﻿Didn't you see?

618
01:23:47,406 --> 01:23:49,685
﻿Malhun took Holofira and left.

619
01:23:49,806 --> 01:23:53,005
﻿What else can your brother
do except for coming here?

620
01:23:54,126 --> 01:23:58,965
﻿Really, mother...
After what Holofira did...

621
01:23:59,126 --> 01:24:02,205
﻿..will my mother accept her?

622
01:24:05,246 --> 01:24:07,405
Let's hope so.

623
01:24:09,606 --> 01:24:14,365
﻿What about you? Did you test Gonca?

624
01:24:14,486 --> 01:24:18,365
﻿What do you think? Do you think
she will be a good daughter-in-law?

625
01:24:18,446 --> 01:24:22,765
﻿Look at you... You are
trying to make me speak, huh?

626
01:24:22,926 --> 01:24:26,285
﻿Come on, mother... What do you think?

627
01:24:31,406 --> 01:24:35,325
﻿Gonca is a good girl. She
was raised well, it's obvious.

628
01:24:35,526 --> 01:24:40,485
﻿But... I cannot say the
same thing for Saadet Hatun.

629
01:24:43,286 --> 01:24:47,525
﻿And daughters are raised by their mothers.

630
01:24:48,766 --> 01:24:52,725
﻿I will observe her for
some more time... But...

631
01:24:52,886 --> 01:24:56,485
﻿...we need someone who is
close to her and knows her better.

632
01:24:56,886 --> 01:25:02,685
﻿I have someone in my mind,
but I don't know if she will help us.

633
01:25:03,246 --> 01:25:06,965
﻿Do you mean Ulgen?

634
01:25:29,486 --> 01:25:33,405
-We will part our ways here, Osman Bey.
-Okay.

635
01:25:33,486 --> 01:25:36,885
﻿Now Saadet Hatun is
waiting for us in Yenisehir.

636
01:25:37,006 --> 01:25:40,365
﻿Come with us, so she can be relieved.

637
01:25:40,526 --> 01:25:44,525
﻿If I go there with you, my mother will
not be the only one who will get happy.

638
01:25:44,846 --> 01:25:47,885
﻿Our route leads us to many ways now.

639
01:25:47,966 --> 01:25:52,205
﻿We have friends and enemies...
Let's not make them happy.

640
01:25:52,286 --> 01:25:55,045
﻿As you wish, Mehmet Bey.

641
01:25:55,726 --> 01:26:00,685
﻿But this is not something we should hide.
Everyone will hear it sooner or later.

642
01:26:01,006 --> 01:26:04,765
-It's your decision.
-Thank you Osman Bey.

643
01:26:05,206 --> 01:26:07,805
﻿owe you my life.

644
01:26:07,886 --> 01:26:11,645
﻿When the right time comes,
don't doubt that I'll pay it back.

645
01:26:11,766 --> 01:26:13,925
Thank you.

646
01:26:14,246 --> 01:26:17,885
-May you go safely.
-Thank you.

647
01:26:29,366 --> 01:26:32,205
﻿Come and drink our cold ayran, Mehmet Bey.

648
01:26:32,286 --> 01:26:35,925
﻿-We have common memories now.
-Do not think that we are equal...

649
01:26:36,166 --> 01:26:41,125
﻿...because we were at the same
place and suffered together, Orhan Bey.

650
01:26:42,566 --> 01:26:46,765
﻿Go and drink your ayran
in the face of your father.

651
01:26:52,846 --> 01:26:55,325
﻿You are so arrogant that..

652
01:26:55,566 --> 01:26:58,725
﻿...you are even insulting
the ones who saved your life.

653
01:26:59,326 --> 01:27:04,205
﻿Go now, Mehmet. That day is not today.

654
01:27:04,766 --> 01:27:07,325
﻿Go.

655
01:27:11,966 --> 01:27:15,365
﻿You will learn when that day comes, Orhan.

656
01:27:15,606 --> 01:27:19,725
﻿You will learn. Come on!

657
01:27:27,886 --> 01:27:35,365
﻿We still haven't received any news. I
will question them once I get out of here.

658
01:27:37,206 --> 01:27:41,725
-Bala...
-Open it.

659
01:27:51,086 --> 01:27:54,285
﻿Now you are free, Saadet Hatun.

660
01:27:54,446 --> 01:27:57,365
﻿-Any news from my Mehmed?
-I have good news.

661
01:27:57,446 --> 01:27:59,525
﻿Orhan and Mehmed are safe.

662
01:27:59,606 --> 01:28:01,765
﻿Osman Bey saved them, they are on the way.

663
01:28:01,846 --> 01:28:04,645
-Thanks to Allah!
-Thanks to Allah, mother!

664
01:28:04,686 --> 01:28:08,205
-Thanks to Allah!
-Bala Hatun...

665
01:28:09,286 --> 01:28:11,925
﻿I came together with my son but...

666
01:28:12,006 --> 01:28:14,765
﻿...I will not forget this impudency.

667
01:28:14,886 --> 01:28:17,565
﻿I will question you about this.

668
01:28:20,326 --> 01:28:24,125
﻿I did everything for our
children, Saadet Hatun.

669
01:28:24,206 --> 01:28:27,365
﻿Let your son come first, hug him...

670
01:28:27,446 --> 01:28:29,805
﻿..then we'll talk about these.

671
01:28:36,486 --> 01:28:40,885
﻿My son knows where to go.

672
01:28:42,566 --> 01:28:48,685
﻿Cerkutay Bey. Prepare
the horses, we are leaving.

673
01:29:17,286 --> 01:29:21,885
﻿May I ruin and destroy
the house of the nafs...

674
01:29:22,206 --> 01:29:25,685
﻿...and may ambition and lust burn with it.

675
01:29:26,766 --> 01:29:31,405
﻿Let me open my hands to pray..

676
01:29:31,726 --> 01:29:34,605
﻿...and fight with my nafs.

677
01:29:51,366 --> 01:29:55,805
-Peace be upon youi, Dervish.
-Peace be upon you too.

678
01:29:57,046 --> 01:30:00,445
﻿What are you doing on
this road with no horse?

679
01:30:00,726 --> 01:30:04,765
﻿I was performing ablution.

680
01:30:05,806 --> 01:30:10,485
﻿Do you think people cannot do
anything on this road without a horse?

681
01:30:10,606 --> 01:30:14,085
﻿Astagfirullah. I did not mean that.

682
01:30:17,326 --> 01:30:21,405
﻿There are many bandits and
sinners (criminals) on this road.

683
01:30:21,486 --> 01:30:23,605
﻿We can accompany you if you wish.

684
01:30:23,726 --> 01:30:28,725
﻿Thank you. We are going a different way.

685
01:30:29,246 --> 01:30:35,445
﻿Considering your wounds, you
have already met those sinners.

686
01:30:37,086 --> 01:30:39,805
﻿You got out of a little fight...

687
01:30:39,966 --> 01:30:43,245
﻿...and now you are trying to
arrive on time for the big fight.

688
01:30:43,246 --> 01:30:47,365
﻿We've been through some
things... Allah knows how small...

689
01:30:47,486 --> 01:30:51,645
﻿...or big it is.

690
01:30:53,326 --> 01:30:56,805
﻿How do you know we are going somewhere?

691
01:30:57,686 --> 01:31:03,045
﻿Come, sit. Have some rest. Let
me offer you something to eat.

692
01:31:19,166 --> 01:31:24,045
﻿So, Dervish Efendi. How do you
know we are going somewhere?

693
01:31:31,526 --> 01:31:35,165
﻿We are not saying it because
we are the ones who know.

694
01:31:35,326 --> 01:31:38,445
﻿Do you know Rasulullah's
(PBUH) expedition of Tabuk?

695
01:31:38,446 --> 01:31:40,445
Peace be upon him.

696
01:31:40,486 --> 01:31:41,245
﻿I do.

697
01:31:42,286 --> 01:31:46,005
﻿It was the expedition in which he
participated with the largest army.

698
01:31:46,086 --> 01:31:51,205
﻿When he returned to Medina after that war...

699
01:31:51,286 --> 01:31:53,885
﻿...he said to his sahabas:

700
01:31:53,966 --> 01:31:58,285
﻿You have come from the
little jihad to the great jihad."

701
01:31:58,646 --> 01:32:04,205
﻿When his sahabas asked, "What
is the great jihad, O Rasulullah?"...

702
01:32:05,126 --> 01:32:09,129
﻿...he said, "The great
jihad is the jihad you wage

703
01:32:09,141 --> 01:32:12,925
against the desires and
ambition of your nafs." .

704
01:32:13,846 --> 01:32:18,885
﻿If you ask what the desires
and ambitions of the nafs are...

705
01:32:19,246 --> 01:32:21,845
﻿...for some it is gold,
for some it is titles...

706
01:32:21,966 --> 01:32:26,205
﻿...some fill it with the
ambition for the chair...

707
01:32:26,326 --> 01:32:29,725
﻿...others fill it with ambition for friends.

708
01:32:31,846 --> 01:32:35,925
﻿Now you're asking...

709
01:32:36,326 --> 01:32:39,925
﻿..."Why is this old
dervish telling me these?"

710
01:32:40,086 --> 01:32:44,165
﻿I'm telling you because the
person in front of me is a human.

711
01:32:44,886 --> 01:32:48,285
﻿Humans have nafs.

712
01:32:48,606 --> 01:32:53,125
﻿Nafs is the total of your ambitions.

713
01:32:53,646 --> 01:32:57,125
﻿We need to learn how to defeat it.

714
01:32:59,606 --> 01:33:03,565
We shall overcome our
nafs(self) and surrender to Allah.

715
01:33:03,646 --> 01:33:07,405
﻿Those surrendering to Allah will find peace.

716
01:33:07,446 --> 01:33:12,245
﻿If you can't peace, you'll
give the leash to your nafs...

717
01:33:12,326 --> 01:33:14,605
﻿...and be a companion of Satan.

718
01:33:14,686 --> 01:33:19,765
﻿Be careful. He would leave
no peace and order in the world.

719
01:33:20,206 --> 01:33:27,445
﻿Although you are wounded, you got out of the
battle and arrived here. It means you won.

720
01:33:28,726 --> 01:33:32,885
If Allah permits,
you will defeat your nafs(self) too.

721
01:33:35,806 --> 01:33:39,925
﻿I should get going now.

722
01:33:46,646 --> 01:33:49,365
﻿Have a safe journey.

723
01:33:50,566 --> 01:33:55,685
Thank you Dervish, Thank you.

724
01:34:14,566 --> 01:34:17,405
﻿Brother!

725
01:34:17,566 --> 01:34:20,605
﻿-My sister.
-Welcome, my Bey.

726
01:34:21,966 --> 01:34:24,445
﻿Thank you.

727
01:34:29,086 --> 01:34:31,509
We got rid of another
trouble, thanks to Allah.

728
01:34:31,509 --> 01:34:32,515
Thanks to Allah.

729
01:34:33,806 --> 01:34:36,605
﻿-Mother.
-Son.

730
01:34:40,446 --> 01:34:44,005
﻿Fatma, just stop.

731
01:34:44,166 --> 01:34:47,365
﻿We saved him from the
heathens. Don't choke him.

732
01:34:47,566 --> 01:34:50,885
﻿Well... I was so scared, father.

733
01:34:51,206 --> 01:34:55,005
﻿Come to me. Come here.

734
01:35:03,966 --> 01:35:06,405
﻿Holofira.

735
01:35:07,606 --> 01:35:11,685
﻿Thank you. You saved us from a huge trouble.

736
01:35:11,966 --> 01:35:15,405
﻿-You acted bravely.
-You're welcome, Osman Bey.

737
01:35:15,646 --> 01:35:17,925
﻿Thank you.

738
01:35:25,526 --> 01:35:28,405
﻿Leave some for us, Fatma Hatun!

739
01:35:28,806 --> 01:35:31,325
﻿Thanks to Allah, brother!

740
01:35:31,366 --> 01:35:33,405
﻿My brother...

741
01:35:33,646 --> 01:35:36,525
﻿Thanks to Allah.

742
01:35:37,766 --> 01:35:39,725
﻿I never doubted you would come.

743
01:35:39,846 --> 01:35:43,485
﻿Well, I just wanted to visit Kestel.

744
01:35:43,726 --> 01:35:48,445
﻿Captivity can do nothing to us. Come here.

745
01:35:56,286 --> 01:35:59,325
﻿Make the preparations.

746
01:35:59,446 --> 01:36:02,045
We're going to the border market.

747
01:36:04,046 --> 01:36:06,165
﻿What are we going to do there, father?

748
01:36:06,206 --> 01:36:08,925
﻿It's not only us who endured the hardships.

749
01:36:08,926 --> 01:36:11,325
﻿Germiyans suffered too.

750
01:36:11,966 --> 01:36:15,125
﻿We'll go say our good wishes.

751
01:36:15,406 --> 01:36:18,845
﻿And show our strength.

752
01:36:20,846 --> 01:36:23,165
﻿-Boran.
-My Bey.

753
01:36:23,246 --> 01:36:27,685
﻿Go ahead and let them know we're coming.

754
01:36:28,326 --> 01:36:32,645
﻿-We'll make a fancy entrance.
-As you order, my Bey.

755
01:36:38,526 --> 01:36:41,525
GERMIYANOGULLARI BORDER - BORDER MARKET

756
01:36:44,766 --> 01:36:46,845
﻿Do I have permission, my Bey?

757
01:36:46,886 --> 01:36:50,245
﻿Mehmed? Come in, son.

758
01:37:05,086 --> 01:37:08,085
﻿What did they do to you, son?

759
01:37:08,566 --> 01:37:13,565
﻿Jackals' mouths watered when
they saw a wolf cub, my Bey.

760
01:37:14,886 --> 01:37:19,645
﻿But I endured their torture.

761
01:37:20,006 --> 01:37:22,725
﻿And I never gave up.

762
01:37:23,286 --> 01:37:25,685
﻿Thanks to Allah.

763
01:37:25,846 --> 01:37:30,285
﻿Thanks to Allah, I'm talking
to you here in our tent.

764
01:37:31,326 --> 01:37:33,765
﻿My brave boy.

765
01:37:34,926 --> 01:37:36,645
﻿-Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

766
01:37:36,686 --> 01:37:38,925
﻿Send a message to doctors.

767
01:37:39,046 --> 01:37:41,805
﻿Tell them to check my boy's wounds.

768
01:37:41,926 --> 01:37:44,325
﻿As you order, my Bey.

769
01:37:45,286 --> 01:37:49,405
﻿Come. Have a seat.

770
01:37:55,526 --> 01:38:00,125
﻿Tell me everything from the beginning.

771
01:38:03,806 --> 01:38:07,365
﻿They ambushed us suddenly, my Bey.

772
01:38:08,086 --> 01:38:10,485
﻿We had made a plan.

773
01:38:10,766 --> 01:38:14,525
﻿Orhan went in first and then I did.

774
01:38:38,326 --> 01:38:41,925
﻿Alps, stop.

775
01:38:56,366 --> 01:39:01,245
﻿You set your eyes on our
lands and made some games.

776
01:39:01,686 --> 01:39:04,085
﻿But you failed.

777
01:39:04,446 --> 01:39:07,325
﻿It's not easy to invade Turkish lands.

778
01:39:07,326 --> 01:39:09,925
﻿What do you want from me?

779
01:39:09,966 --> 01:39:13,005
﻿Everything you own.

780
01:39:23,086 --> 01:39:26,925
﻿This is the end, Lord. Move!

781
01:39:30,726 --> 01:39:36,005
﻿-You can't get away with this.
-Don't worry about that.

782
01:39:36,686 --> 01:39:41,645
﻿Listen to me carefully.
You'll do whatever I say.

783
01:39:42,006 --> 01:39:45,365
﻿Make a mistake and you die.

784
01:39:45,446 --> 01:39:48,805
﻿Did you hear, Lord?

785
01:39:52,206 --> 01:39:54,525
﻿Keep your eyes wide open. Let's go.

786
01:40:10,286 --> 01:40:14,365
-In the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate
-Does it hurt too much?

787
01:40:18,966 --> 01:40:21,805
When I saw you...

788
01:40:22,166 --> 01:40:25,725
...all the pain was gone.

789
01:40:34,966 --> 01:40:37,805
﻿If it makes you look after me,

790
01:40:38,126 --> 01:40:40,405
﻿...I will gladly get
wounds, daughter of Lord.

791
01:40:40,486 --> 01:40:43,325
﻿Do not. Don't.

792
01:40:43,686 --> 01:40:47,045
﻿Don't be wounded again, Orhan.

793
01:40:49,926 --> 01:40:52,685
﻿Your mother was so afraid.

794
01:40:52,966 --> 01:40:55,605
﻿Probably, she was.

795
01:40:56,286 --> 01:41:01,125
﻿While I was leaving, I told
you to get along well with her.

796
01:41:01,446 --> 01:41:04,085
﻿But you did even more...

797
01:41:04,606 --> 01:41:08,405
﻿...and came to save me with my mother, huh?

798
01:41:09,726 --> 01:41:12,565
﻿It seems only my mother was afraid.

799
01:41:13,126 --> 01:41:17,365
﻿You? Weren’t you
afraid, Holofira?

800
01:41:17,726 --> 01:41:22,525
﻿was every afraid that...

801
01:41:22,726 --> 01:41:25,165
﻿...you might die.

802
01:41:26,206 --> 01:41:28,845
﻿So was I.

803
01:41:33,286 --> 01:41:37,085
﻿I was afraid that I might not see...

804
01:41:37,726 --> 01:41:40,765
﻿...these eyes again, Holofira.

805
01:41:42,126 --> 01:41:46,685
﻿-We need to heal your wounds.
-It doesn't hurt.

806
01:41:49,126 --> 01:41:52,205
﻿I told you something while I was leaving.

807
01:41:53,006 --> 01:41:57,485
﻿You said we'd talk when I came back.
You remember?

808
01:41:58,046 --> 01:42:01,245
﻿-Yes?
-Well...

809
01:42:03,486 --> 01:42:06,045
﻿While I was captive,

810
01:42:06,726 --> 01:42:10,085
﻿..I had time to think.

811
01:42:12,766 --> 01:42:15,725
﻿Holofira.

812
01:42:16,286 --> 01:42:20,205
-I am in lo...
-Brother?

813
01:42:23,006 --> 01:42:24,485
﻿Sister.

814
01:42:28,726 --> 01:42:31,445
﻿Mother wants to see you.

815
01:42:31,806 --> 01:42:35,245
﻿She wants to see me?

816
01:42:37,086 --> 01:42:40,965
﻿Go. We'll talk again.

817
01:42:41,286 --> 01:42:46,085
﻿Don't keep her waiting.
She was very afraid for you.

818
01:42:53,046 --> 01:42:57,085
﻿-You had to come just in time, right?
-Mother wanted to see you.

819
01:42:57,246 --> 01:43:01,325
﻿Mother. What could I have done, brother?

820
01:43:01,406 --> 01:43:03,325
﻿What were you saying to Holofira?

821
01:43:03,406 --> 01:43:04,885
﻿Nothing.

822
01:43:04,966 --> 01:43:08,605
﻿-What were you saying?
-You'd tell both mother and father.

823
01:43:08,726 --> 01:43:10,445
﻿Brother!

824
01:43:10,486 --> 01:43:13,605
﻿Mehmed, my dear! My son!

825
01:43:13,686 --> 01:43:17,445
﻿-Mother.
-Are you alright, dear?

826
01:43:18,126 --> 01:43:23,725
﻿-What did you do to you, son?
-I'm good, mother. Don't worry

827
01:43:24,006 --> 01:43:28,005
Their hands with which they hit you
shall break!

828
01:43:28,406 --> 01:43:33,885
﻿-Brother? Brother!
-Sister.

829
01:43:34,366 --> 01:43:36,365
﻿Brother!

830
01:43:36,726 --> 01:43:40,085
﻿Are you alright? I got
worried about you, brother!

831
01:43:40,086 --> 01:43:42,885
﻿-I'm fine, sister.
-He's good.

832
01:43:43,166 --> 01:43:46,485
﻿He's good. Such little wounds...

833
01:43:46,486 --> 01:43:49,365
﻿..can't harm my son.

834
01:43:54,526 --> 01:43:57,045
﻿Fitnat, I made a vow.

835
01:43:57,286 --> 01:44:01,485
﻿Get some animals sacrificed
and hand out meat to people.

836
01:44:02,126 --> 01:44:05,325
﻿Mehmed.

837
01:44:09,006 --> 01:44:13,245
-Do I have permission, my Bey?
-Come in.

838
01:44:13,326 --> 01:44:16,565
-Come in, Orhan.
-Peace be upon you.

839
01:44:16,846 --> 01:44:19,725
Peace be upon you too.

840
01:44:25,126 --> 01:44:29,885
Praise be, praise be, praise be!

841
01:44:30,046 --> 01:44:34,365
﻿Thank Allah, for making
us unite in one table again.

842
01:44:34,566 --> 01:44:37,085
﻿-Thank Allah.
-Thank Allah.

843
01:44:37,206 --> 01:44:39,845
﻿My heart was in a cell with my Orhan.

844
01:44:39,926 --> 01:44:45,005
﻿-Now, they are both free, thank Allah.
-Thank Allah.

845
01:44:45,646 --> 01:44:47,965
﻿Thank Allah.

846
01:44:48,166 --> 01:44:52,445
Come on then, In the name of Allah,
the compassionate, the merciful.

847
01:44:52,806 --> 01:44:55,765
﻿-Take it.
-Enjoy the meal.

848
01:44:55,926 --> 01:45:00,125
I am so hungry, take it sister.

849
01:45:00,246 --> 01:45:03,965
﻿When talking with Holofira..

850
01:45:04,206 --> 01:45:07,845
﻿You are never this hun..

851
01:45:16,486 --> 01:45:22,565
﻿Look here. Let my daughter speak.

852
01:45:22,726 --> 01:45:26,725
﻿You are poking her on each side.

853
01:45:29,046 --> 01:45:32,525
﻿What is this?

854
01:45:38,766 --> 01:45:43,445
﻿-Say it.
-My brothers..

855
01:45:46,606 --> 01:45:49,605
﻿Do not do anything.

856
01:45:49,686 --> 01:45:53,485
﻿Right, bey. We do not do anything.

857
01:45:56,086 --> 01:46:00,365
﻿-They do everything I say.
-We do, bey.

858
01:46:00,646 --> 01:46:04,925
﻿-We do.
-They do not have any secrets?

859
01:46:05,006 --> 01:46:10,565
﻿For example..

860
01:46:12,966 --> 01:46:16,005
﻿Affairs of heart.

861
01:46:22,086 --> 01:46:26,085
﻿-I don't know.
-Sister.

862
01:46:26,846 --> 01:46:32,245
﻿-Orhan brother.
-I have it under control, bey.

863
01:46:33,406 --> 01:46:37,325
﻿The girls are ready. If not today..

864
01:46:37,406 --> 01:46:40,885
﻿We will meet them in the future.

865
01:46:41,886 --> 01:46:46,325
﻿Then we would gather the council.
No trouble gathering it, after all.

866
01:46:46,606 --> 01:46:49,765
﻿Right, shahzades?

867
01:46:49,926 --> 01:46:56,925
﻿Of course. Let us gather
the council, dance and enjoy.

868
01:46:57,006 --> 01:47:00,965
﻿Bottoms up, while it is cold.

869
01:47:01,206 --> 01:47:05,005
﻿-Stop it sister.
-It is good for you.

870
01:47:05,126 --> 01:47:08,165
﻿My brothers.

871
01:47:09,846 --> 01:47:14,285
﻿It is good for them of course.

872
01:47:19,566 --> 01:47:21,685
﻿Father.

873
01:47:22,046 --> 01:47:26,885
﻿When will we take vengeance from Kestel.

874
01:47:27,126 --> 01:47:32,125
﻿Very soon.

875
01:47:35,286 --> 01:47:38,845
﻿Bey, where is Konur Bey?

876
01:47:39,046 --> 01:47:43,485
﻿-They did not come back to the palace yet.
-Konur is on duty.

877
01:47:43,566 --> 01:47:48,765
﻿We gave him a duty. However..

878
01:47:49,446 --> 01:47:52,805
﻿The move we will make..

879
01:47:52,886 --> 01:47:56,085
﻿Will divide Yakup Bey and us.

880
01:47:58,526 --> 01:48:00,965
﻿We rescued Mehmed with Orhan.

881
01:48:01,086 --> 01:48:04,525
﻿Instead of being grateful
why would it divide us?

882
01:48:05,646 --> 01:48:11,325
﻿Mehmed Bey is so arrogant, mother.
He may even hold grudge against us..

883
01:48:11,406 --> 01:48:14,085
﻿Instead of being grateful.

884
01:48:15,926 --> 01:48:22,085
﻿It is like his father,
Yakup Bey is no different.

885
01:48:23,686 --> 01:48:26,605
﻿We do not expect gratitude from them.

886
01:48:26,726 --> 01:48:29,885
﻿We do not give them a reason to hold grudge.

887
01:48:29,966 --> 01:48:34,565
﻿However, we will answer them..

888
01:48:35,526 --> 01:48:39,565
﻿Just as how they answered us.

889
01:48:41,286 --> 01:48:46,325
﻿Osman Bey will do more
than he says, it seems.

890
01:48:47,726 --> 01:48:51,005
﻿Doing more than what mad says..

891
01:48:51,246 --> 01:48:55,005
﻿Makes you aim more than what he sees.

892
01:48:56,726 --> 01:49:03,405
You will see what I will do in
the border market as well.

893
01:49:28,406 --> 01:49:31,405
GERMIYANOGULLARI BORDER / BORDER MARKET

894
01:49:33,726 --> 01:49:37,405
﻿You go ahead with sacrificals, hatun.

895
01:49:37,486 --> 01:49:40,845
﻿I am thinking about settling business.

896
01:49:45,326 --> 01:49:49,725
﻿-What business, father?
-We are ready..

897
01:49:49,846 --> 01:49:53,645
﻿To give our lives for this land. However..

898
01:49:53,726 --> 01:49:59,485
﻿They endangered my son's
life for a couple of castles.

899
01:49:59,726 --> 01:50:03,685
﻿It is always because of
their weaknesses, Yakup Bey.

900
01:50:03,766 --> 01:50:06,965
﻿They spend lives for a couple of castles.

901
01:50:07,406 --> 01:50:11,085
﻿They see them as more precious than life.

902
01:50:12,566 --> 01:50:16,405
﻿I also have a business to settle.

903
01:50:19,646 --> 01:50:22,685
﻿They put us in that cell.

904
01:50:22,766 --> 01:50:25,845
﻿What cell, hatun?

905
01:50:33,686 --> 01:50:37,845
﻿They say that they are tricking the traitor.

906
01:50:38,326 --> 01:50:41,085
﻿They humiliated us..

907
01:50:41,166 --> 01:50:45,445
﻿In the first chance they got.

908
01:50:48,326 --> 01:50:53,565
﻿Didn't they tell us after, mother?
My brother got released after as well.

909
01:50:55,446 --> 01:50:58,525
﻿What are you defending, Gonca?

910
01:50:58,646 --> 01:51:01,205
﻿They collected reputation by saving me.

911
01:51:01,326 --> 01:51:05,925
﻿They put you in the cell.
These are all their trickery.

912
01:51:07,486 --> 01:51:11,885
﻿May Allah be my witness, I
will answer to all of this, father.

913
01:51:15,046 --> 01:51:20,405
﻿Your place and your tongue
defends them too much.

914
01:51:21,086 --> 01:51:25,965
﻿Look after your heart in
this Alaeddin issue, Gonca.

915
01:51:27,046 --> 01:51:30,965
﻿Of course, mother. It is duty.

916
01:51:33,326 --> 01:51:38,765
﻿They do good deeds.

917
01:51:40,326 --> 01:51:43,765
﻿Under every sincere move they make..

918
01:51:43,886 --> 01:51:49,365
﻿Is filled with trickery.
They put my family in a cell.

919
01:51:49,846 --> 01:51:52,805
﻿They disobey my order..

920
01:51:53,046 --> 01:51:55,805
﻿And make moves with their own will.

921
01:51:55,886 --> 01:51:58,565
﻿It is time to call them out for it, bey.

922
01:51:59,006 --> 01:52:02,445
﻿We will, son.

923
01:52:03,606 --> 01:52:08,245
﻿Very soon, when they least expect it..

924
01:52:08,366 --> 01:52:11,845
﻿We will be on them.

925
01:52:25,326 --> 01:52:29,525
﻿I told myself not to..
Told myself to forget it..

926
01:52:30,526 --> 01:52:35,565
﻿Do you see the place they
see us fit for, it is prison.

927
01:52:36,646 --> 01:52:41,125
﻿Do you think you would stay
still if they didn't put you in?

928
01:52:41,246 --> 01:52:45,245
﻿Look, Osman Bey rescued both
Mehmed Bey and Orhan Bey.

929
01:52:46,646 --> 01:52:52,125
﻿When will you open your eyes.

930
01:53:10,286 --> 01:53:15,485
﻿O people, gather around.

931
01:53:16,686 --> 01:53:21,565
﻿Cerkutay, what is Boran Bey doing?

932
01:53:22,566 --> 01:53:26,525
﻿I have very important news to tell.

933
01:53:27,006 --> 01:53:29,325
﻿is good news.

934
01:53:31,006 --> 01:53:36,125
﻿There is something, we'll figure it out now.

935
01:53:49,446 --> 01:53:55,085
﻿Leader of Ghazis, the mighty
Bey of the tribe, Osman Bey..

936
01:53:55,286 --> 01:54:01,325
﻿Has rescued Orhan Bey, and
Mehmed Bey, son of Yakup Bey..

937
01:54:02,326 --> 01:54:04,925
﻿From the hands of the infidels.

938
01:54:16,846 --> 01:54:19,965
﻿Cerkutay.

939
01:54:23,006 --> 01:54:26,085
﻿Shut him up.

940
01:54:29,366 --> 01:54:32,285
﻿I'll go.

941
01:54:37,486 --> 01:54:42,125
﻿Boran. What are you doing?

942
01:54:42,926 --> 01:54:47,005
﻿This is Yakup Bey's property.
You can't shout without permission.

943
01:54:47,086 --> 01:54:52,085
﻿We are of the strong voice, who
doesn't think about permissions, Cerkutay.

944
01:54:52,366 --> 01:54:56,925
﻿You knew this as well,
when did you forget it?

945
01:54:57,246 --> 01:55:01,045
﻿Boran, Boran.

946
01:55:01,166 --> 01:55:04,445
﻿Don't make me mad.

947
01:55:04,846 --> 01:55:08,965
﻿You are interrupting my
duty. Get off and be quiet.

948
01:55:16,486 --> 01:55:21,205
﻿Yakup Bey tamed you pretty well, brother.

949
01:55:22,686 --> 01:55:26,005
﻿My brother would come back.

950
01:55:26,566 --> 01:55:30,845
﻿But you became like one of
them by drinking Germiyans' water.

951
01:55:31,846 --> 01:55:34,445
﻿Stop, stop!

952
01:55:34,566 --> 01:55:39,325
﻿A random arrow will hit
you Boran brother, get down.

953
01:55:39,446 --> 01:55:42,125
﻿Come on.

954
01:56:22,766 --> 01:56:26,405
- Peace be upon you!
- Peace be upon you too!

955
01:56:37,206 --> 01:56:40,805
﻿Thank you. Thank you.

956
01:56:40,886 --> 01:56:42,525
﻿Osman Bey.

957
01:56:46,126 --> 01:56:48,165
﻿Oh my child.

958
01:56:48,326 --> 01:56:51,325
﻿Thank you friends.

959
01:56:51,486 --> 01:56:54,325
﻿-Thank you, thank you.
-May Allah bless you.

960
01:56:54,406 --> 01:56:57,925
﻿May Allah bless you too.

961
01:56:58,126 --> 01:57:01,565
﻿-Long live Osman Bey!
-Thank you.

962
01:57:01,646 --> 01:57:06,045
﻿Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

963
01:57:20,086 --> 01:57:25,245
﻿And now you’re testing my patience
by gathering people behind you.

964
01:57:26,286 --> 01:57:30,365
﻿If you have any trouble or any bothering

965
01:57:30,566 --> 01:57:35,645
﻿we're always here and
we're ready to do our best.

966
01:57:36,686 --> 01:57:39,085
﻿Thank you.

967
01:57:40,686 --> 01:57:44,325
﻿What's this disgrace, Osman Bey?

968
01:57:52,006 --> 01:57:54,205
﻿So.

969
01:57:54,526 --> 01:57:58,645
﻿Sultan Yakup had some flaws.

970
01:57:58,726 --> 01:58:02,405
﻿And we were fixing them.

971
01:58:02,526 --> 01:58:05,085
﻿What is our flaw?

972
01:58:07,646 --> 01:58:10,325
﻿In Lefke Castle

973
01:58:10,406 --> 01:58:13,205
﻿you saved us from the infidels.

974
01:58:13,886 --> 01:58:18,445
Mashallah! You had
all the world hear about it.

975
01:58:20,086 --> 01:58:25,685
﻿You said "I saved Osman
Bey from the infidels."

976
01:58:27,126 --> 01:58:31,565
﻿Isn't that right, Yakup
Bey? Didn't you say so?

977
01:58:37,006 --> 01:58:42,165
﻿And we attacked Kestel Castle.

978
01:58:42,766 --> 01:58:46,445
﻿We saved your son Mehmed.

979
01:58:49,206 --> 01:58:51,045
﻿Here we are.

980
01:58:51,806 --> 01:58:54,205
﻿But you don't even say a word.

981
01:58:55,446 --> 01:59:01,085
﻿I can see that you keep silent.

982
01:59:06,006 --> 01:59:10,045
﻿You forget pretty quickly, Yakup Bey.

983
01:59:10,486 --> 01:59:12,565
﻿Pretty quickly.

984
01:59:12,686 --> 01:59:15,205
﻿I didn't forget
about it Osman Bey.

985
01:59:15,406 --> 01:59:20,045
﻿I was going to take the boys safe and sound.

986
01:59:20,246 --> 01:59:26,045
﻿You made it complicated. You
put yourself and them in danger.

987
01:59:26,166 --> 01:59:28,925
﻿I left for Lefke too.

988
01:59:29,686 --> 01:59:33,205
﻿But you acted before
me. As if that's not enough

989
01:59:33,326 --> 01:59:36,485
﻿you made the whole world hear about it.

990
01:59:38,926 --> 01:59:41,405
﻿So what, Yakup Bey?

991
01:59:42,046 --> 01:59:45,205
﻿First one to go takes what he wants.

992
01:59:45,766 --> 01:59:51,525
﻿And makes the people hear about it.

993
01:59:52,966 --> 01:59:54,645
﻿Isn't that right, people?

994
01:59:54,726 --> 01:59:57,445
﻿Yes, Osman Bey!

995
01:59:57,566 --> 02:00:00,885
﻿Long live Osman Bey!

996
02:00:32,046 --> 02:00:36,605
﻿Clear the way and drop your weapons.

997
02:00:49,566 --> 02:00:52,485
﻿I'll cut the Lord's head now!

998
02:00:52,726 --> 02:00:54,805
﻿Do what he says.

999
02:00:54,886 --> 02:00:57,205
﻿Sir, are you sure?

1000
02:00:57,446 --> 02:01:00,845
﻿I said do it, it is an order!

1001
02:01:22,526 --> 02:01:27,525
﻿Go to the wall, turn around and kneel.

1002
02:01:36,326 --> 02:01:41,365
﻿Take their guns and arrest the soldiers.

1003
02:02:09,526 --> 02:02:17,925
﻿Long live Osman Bey!

1004
02:02:18,566 --> 02:02:21,725
﻿Is what we hear true, Sultan Yakup?

1005
02:02:21,966 --> 02:02:26,165
﻿You tried to give away Lefke
where my son was martyred

1006
02:02:26,246 --> 02:02:29,605
﻿just to save your child?

1007
02:02:29,926 --> 02:02:32,551
﻿If it wasn't for Osman
Bey, you were going to let

1008
02:02:32,563 --> 02:02:35,045
the infidels get away
with our children's death.

1009
02:02:35,126 --> 02:02:36,485
﻿Enough!

1010
02:02:43,086 --> 02:02:46,085
﻿Is that true, Yakup Bey?

1011
02:02:52,326 --> 02:02:54,565
﻿Tell us the truth!

1012
02:03:00,166 --> 02:03:02,565
﻿Look at me.

1013
02:03:02,806 --> 02:03:05,325
﻿Don't touch her.

1014
02:03:19,806 --> 02:03:25,085
﻿Stay back.

1015
02:03:36,126 --> 02:03:38,645
﻿Go away!

1016
02:04:02,726 --> 02:04:05,925
﻿Anyone who shuts the righteous

1017
02:04:06,766 --> 02:04:10,405
﻿is not from us.

1018
02:04:10,806 --> 02:04:16,765
﻿He is not from us, let alone being a Sultan!

1019
02:04:18,326 --> 02:04:21,725
﻿Are you rebelling against me, Osman Bey?

1020
02:04:25,726 --> 02:04:30,485
﻿In this path which we took
the rule the whole world,

1021
02:04:31,406 --> 02:04:33,965
﻿if it was up to you

1022
02:04:34,526 --> 02:04:39,045
﻿we were going to lose all of our lands.

1023
02:04:45,526 --> 02:04:50,165
﻿My path is not the same as yours.

1024
02:04:51,126 --> 02:04:54,765
﻿I acknowledged you as the Sultan

1025
02:04:55,326 --> 02:04:58,645
﻿because I thought you'd make holy wars.

1026
02:04:59,806 --> 02:05:02,205
﻿I pledged loyalty

1027
02:05:03,166 --> 02:05:07,525
﻿thinking that you'd ruin the infidels.

1028
02:05:15,486 --> 02:05:21,205
﻿But it seems...

1029
02:05:24,486 --> 02:05:26,965
﻿...it seems I was wrong.

1030
02:05:48,766 --> 02:05:52,285
﻿You're playing with fire, Osman Bey.

1031
02:05:53,246 --> 02:05:55,325
﻿If you rebel against me

1032
02:05:55,926 --> 02:05:58,525
﻿I'll destroy you.

1033
02:05:59,486 --> 02:06:03,285
﻿I was born into the circle
of fire in these lands.

1034
02:06:03,726 --> 02:06:08,645
﻿I fought with many cruel people and infidels.

1035
02:06:10,606 --> 02:06:12,605
﻿Yakup Bey.

1036
02:06:13,526 --> 02:06:17,125
For sure, in this world...

1037
02:06:17,326 --> 02:06:20,925
...there's no one I'm afraid of.

1038
02:06:22,806 --> 02:06:25,045
I'm neither cruel...

1039
02:06:25,406 --> 02:06:28,765
...nor am I like the people you came across.

1040
02:06:30,126 --> 02:06:33,325
﻿I'm the Sultan of all the lands.

1041
02:06:34,166 --> 02:06:36,885
If you challenge me...

1042
02:06:37,246 --> 02:06:40,805
...you'll find out what fear means.

1043
02:07:01,486 --> 02:07:03,565
﻿Thankfully.

1044
02:07:04,606 --> 02:07:08,765
﻿Go with Yakup Bey, the castles
will not be enough for them.

1045
02:07:09,766 --> 02:07:12,245
﻿Take Aykurt with you.

1046
02:07:12,446 --> 02:07:16,045
﻿The game that was set against
Yakup Bey will be broken.

1047
02:07:16,286 --> 02:07:19,445
﻿Also, take Lord Makronos as a hostage.

1048
02:07:19,526 --> 02:07:21,445
﻿Konur.

1049
02:07:21,646 --> 02:07:24,325
﻿Kayi banner will be planted in Kestel.

1050
02:07:24,446 --> 02:07:26,165
﻿Yes, my Bey.

1051
02:07:31,446 --> 02:07:36,405
﻿Kestel will not be a land
for you, it will be a graveyard.

1052
02:07:36,486 --> 02:07:40,045
﻿Your banners will be washed by your blood.

1053
02:07:40,286 --> 02:07:42,045
﻿Lord.

1054
02:07:43,086 --> 02:07:46,205
﻿You can’t even defend your castle.

1055
02:07:47,246 --> 02:07:49,925
﻿Are you going to take
Kestel which we will conquer?

1056
02:07:50,006 --> 02:07:53,525
﻿You’ll see it when the day comes.

1057
02:07:53,926 --> 02:07:57,445
﻿The screams of your men will deafen you!

1058
02:07:57,566 --> 02:07:59,045
﻿Look.

1059
02:08:01,206 --> 02:08:03,645
﻿One of our men is equal to
a thousand of your soldiers.

1060
02:08:03,846 --> 02:08:06,205
﻿Do your best.

1061
02:08:06,366 --> 02:08:10,205
﻿Only thing you are
promised is death. Take him.

1062
02:08:21,406 --> 02:08:26,125
-Are you all right?
-Thank you. I'm all right.

1063
02:08:26,726 --> 02:08:30,205
﻿You've set me free
and I'll never forget this.

1064
02:08:30,366 --> 02:08:32,365
Alright.

1065
02:08:32,926 --> 02:08:36,125
﻿Konur Bey. All of the
soldiers have been arrested.

1066
02:08:36,286 --> 02:08:41,245
From now on, we have the
control of the castle, praise be to Allah.

1067
02:08:41,726 --> 02:08:44,445
Thank you.

1068
02:08:45,046 --> 02:08:47,325
﻿Fly Kayi flags on the walls of Kestel.

1069
02:08:47,406 --> 02:08:50,005
﻿The cruel will know that
Kestel is our property.

1070
02:08:50,006 --> 02:08:52,085
﻿The oppressed will be relieved then.

1071
02:08:52,086 --> 02:08:56,125
﻿Yes Konur Bey. Come on valiants.

1072
02:09:06,606 --> 02:09:09,285
﻿So, Yakup Bey..

1073
02:09:09,526 --> 02:09:12,645
﻿You've been announcing
your sultanate for so long.

1074
02:09:15,286 --> 02:09:19,125
﻿You are making everyone
hear about your sultanate.

1075
02:09:19,286 --> 02:09:22,245
﻿There is no one who hasn't heard of it.

1076
02:09:24,646 --> 02:09:30,045
﻿But we haven't seen you
gain a single victory yet.

1077
02:09:35,766 --> 02:09:39,325
﻿The one we call a Sultan..

1078
02:09:40,566 --> 02:09:43,245
﻿...must help the oppressed first.

1079
02:09:44,406 --> 02:09:48,805
﻿He must share the gold with
his people. But we see that...

1080
02:09:49,526 --> 02:09:52,485
﻿...we are the ones who are giving the gold.

1081
02:09:59,606 --> 02:10:04,685
﻿The one we call a Sultan must conquer lands.

1082
02:10:06,766 --> 02:10:09,125
﻿But..

1083
02:10:09,246 --> 02:10:11,805
﻿...we are the ones who are doing it.

1084
02:10:20,646 --> 02:10:23,365
﻿Yakup Bey...

1085
02:10:24,966 --> 02:10:27,965
﻿O, people!

1086
02:10:28,686 --> 02:10:33,445
﻿Kestel castle where our
children were taken captive...

1087
02:10:37,766 --> 02:10:41,285
﻿...is now the property of Kayi!

1088
02:11:00,246 --> 02:11:03,445
﻿Now tell me Yakup Bey.

1089
02:11:03,686 --> 02:11:08,165
﻿Are you the Sultan here...

1090
02:11:11,286 --> 02:11:14,325
﻿...am I the Sultan here?

1091
02:11:15,886 --> 02:11:18,685
﻿You pledged allegiance, Osman.

1092
02:11:18,966 --> 02:11:21,325
﻿I am taking it back now.

1093
02:11:44,166 --> 02:11:48,165
﻿Where are you Tesellius?
Where are you?

1094
02:11:49,806 --> 02:11:55,005
﻿Thomas... Tell our brothers to get ready.

1095
02:11:55,126 --> 02:11:58,485
﻿When Makranos takes the castles...

1096
02:11:58,686 --> 02:12:00,805
﻿...we will take Sogut.

1097
02:12:12,446 --> 02:12:15,005
﻿Tesellius.

1098
02:12:15,686 --> 02:12:19,605
-Where have you been Tesellius?
-Sir, Osman...

1099
02:12:22,606 --> 02:12:26,965
-Speak, Tesellius.
-Osman took the prisoners.

1100
02:12:27,046 --> 02:12:30,685
﻿The castles... They
didn't give those castles.

1101
02:12:31,166 --> 02:12:33,485
﻿Yakup is also alive.

1102
02:12:34,246 --> 02:12:37,365
﻿Unfortunately we failed sir.

1103
02:13:09,166 --> 02:13:12,205
﻿Holy Jesus... Holy Jesus...

1104
02:13:12,286 --> 02:13:15,645
﻿I swear, I swear, I swear...

1105
02:13:15,726 --> 02:13:19,085
﻿I swear, I will kill them!

1106
02:13:19,646 --> 02:13:24,205
﻿Holy Jesus! I am taking an oath before you...

1107
02:13:24,646 --> 02:13:29,325
﻿...I will send Osman to
the deepest place in hell!

1108
02:13:30,046 --> 02:13:32,245
﻿This is not failure!

1109
02:13:32,366 --> 02:13:36,885
﻿This is the last fire Osman
left in us before we kill him!

1110
02:13:36,966 --> 02:13:40,205
﻿The last!

1111
02:13:55,566 --> 02:13:57,685
﻿Master Gera..

1112
02:13:59,486 --> 02:14:01,685
-Did what I thought happen?
-Everything...

1113
02:14:01,886 --> 02:14:05,205
﻿...went wrong, Vasilis!
Everything!

1114
02:14:05,806 --> 02:14:08,485
﻿Osman saved Orhan and Mehmet.

1115
02:14:08,566 --> 02:14:11,925
﻿Yakup is alive! You...

1116
02:14:12,006 --> 02:14:15,045
﻿..how couldn't you notice this game?

1117
02:14:15,126 --> 02:14:17,685
﻿I did... I noticed something was happening...

1118
02:14:17,686 --> 02:14:18,644
﻿You noticed!

1119
02:14:18,656 --> 02:14:21,565
But they were looking for the
traitor. I couldn't do anything...

1120
02:14:21,566 --> 02:14:23,645
﻿If I did, they could have captured me.

1121
02:14:23,726 --> 02:14:25,445
﻿Then why did you come?

1122
02:14:25,646 --> 02:14:29,445
﻿Won't they notice your
absence? Why did you come?

1123
02:14:29,686 --> 02:14:32,725
﻿Won't they doubt about you now?

1124
02:14:32,886 --> 02:14:36,285
-Huh?
-No, they won't.

1125
02:14:37,006 --> 02:14:40,645
﻿Because my position in the
palace is even stronger now.

1126
02:14:40,726 --> 02:14:43,605
﻿It happened just the way
we predicted, Master Gera.

1127
02:14:43,686 --> 02:14:47,312
﻿They checked my back when
they were looking for the traitor.

1128
02:14:47,324 --> 02:14:49,085
And they couldn't see a mark.

1129
02:14:49,926 --> 02:14:52,565
﻿Vasilis...

1130
02:14:54,006 --> 02:14:57,325
﻿You are so valuable.

1131
02:14:57,406 --> 02:15:00,165
﻿Their trust in you is great.

1132
02:15:00,566 --> 02:15:04,325
﻿Their trust in you will bring their end.

1133
02:15:04,566 --> 02:15:08,005
﻿What will be our next move, Master Gera?

1134
02:15:11,286 --> 02:15:14,165
﻿We will play such a game...

1135
02:15:14,326 --> 02:15:17,125
﻿...to Osman and Yakup that...

1136
02:15:17,606 --> 02:15:20,045
﻿...they won't hesitate making an agreement...

1137
02:15:20,126 --> 02:15:24,925
﻿...with the devil to kill each other.

1138
02:15:27,726 --> 02:15:29,805
﻿Now listen to me carefully.

1139
02:15:30,926 --> 02:15:34,085
﻿You pledged allegience, Osman.

1140
02:15:34,966 --> 02:15:38,245
﻿Now I am taking it back.

1141
02:15:51,886 --> 02:15:57,205
﻿You can be anyone's Sultan
now but you are not my Sultan.

1142
02:15:59,526 --> 02:16:03,005
﻿You are not Kayi's Sultan.

1143
02:16:04,286 --> 02:16:10,965
﻿You can never be my people's Sultan either!

1144
02:16:15,366 --> 02:16:18,165
﻿If you want to see us..

1145
02:16:18,646 --> 02:16:23,845
﻿...do not look beside or behind you,
look at who is standing against you!

1146
02:16:26,926 --> 02:16:29,445
﻿From now on..

1147
02:16:29,606 --> 02:16:32,885
﻿...we are rivals, Yakup Bey.

1148
02:16:36,766 --> 02:16:42,885
﻿You have made this rebellion so openly...

1149
02:16:45,165 --> 02:16:48,525
﻿...who will save you from my hands now?

1150
02:16:55,206 --> 02:16:58,725
﻿I will destroy you in such a way that...

1151
02:17:00,004 --> 02:17:01,805
﻿..no one will remember...

1152
02:17:01,886 --> 02:17:08,205
﻿...that there was a man named Osman.

1153
02:17:11,766 --> 02:17:14,805
﻿We will see.

1154
02:17:17,126 --> 02:17:19,485
﻿We will see.

1155
02:17:19,686 --> 02:17:23,165
﻿We will see, Yakup Bey. Who knows...

1156
02:17:23,325 --> 02:17:26,004
﻿...maybe the whole world will hear our name.

1157
02:17:26,726 --> 02:17:31,084
﻿They will be afraid.
They will shake from fear.

1158
02:17:33,566 --> 02:17:39,285
﻿Maybe... we will live on these
lands for hundreds of years.

1159
02:17:39,366 --> 02:17:42,915
﻿But fate... Fate...

1160
02:17:44,245 --> 02:17:49,405
Only Allah...
Only Allah knows that.